{"id": "12th_tamil_mp2_q1779", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "multiple_choice", "level": "medium", "difficulty": "medium", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "12", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "megapack_2", "lesson_id": "synoptic_mock_1", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "culture_word_coining", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "‘Culture’ என்ற ஆங்கிலச் சொல்லுக்கு இணையாகத் தமிழில் ‘பண்பாடு’ என்ற சொல்லை முதன்முதலில் 1937-இல் உருவாக்கியவர் யார்?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "மறைமலையடிகள்", "B": "பாரதியார்", "C": "டி.கே. சிதம்பரநாதனார் (டி.கே.சி)", "D": "வையாபுரிப் பிள்ளை"}, "explanation": "1937-இல் 'Culture' என்ற ஆங்கிலச் சொல்லுக்கு இணையாகப் 'பண்பாடு' என்ற சொல்லை முதன்முதலில் அறிமுகம் செய்து புழக்கத்திற்கு கொண்டுவந்தவர் டி.கே.சி ஆவார்."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "Who first coined and popularized the Tamil word 'Panpaadu' in 1937 for the English term 'Culture'?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "Maraimalai Adigal", "B": "Subramania Bharati", "C": "T.K. Chidambaranathanar (T.K.C)", "D": "S. Vaiyapuri Pillai"}, "explanation": "T.K. Chidambaranathanar (T.K.C) introduced the Tamil equivalent 'Panpaadu' for 'Culture' in 1937."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "C", "accepted_keys": ["C"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "12", "term": "full_year", "edition": "2024-2025", "page": 98, "