{"id": "12th_tamil_mp2_q1786", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "multiple_choice", "level": "hard", "difficulty": "hard", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "12", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "megapack_2", "lesson_id": "synoptic_mock_1", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "meyppattiyal_perumidham", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "தொல்காப்பிய மெய்ப்பாட்டியலின்படி 'பெருமிதம்' (வீரம்/பெருமை) தோன்றுவதற்குரிய நான்கு களங்கள் எவை?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "மூப்பு, பிணி, வருத்தம், மென்மை", "B": "கல்வி, தறுகண், இசைமை, கொடை", "C": "புதுமை, பெருமை, சிறுமை, ஆக்கம்", "D": "அச்சம், வெகுளி, இளிவரல், வியப்பு"}, "explanation": "'கல்வி தறுகண் இசைமை கொடையெனச் சொல்லப் பட்ட நான்கே பெருமிதம்' என்பது தொல்காப்பிய நூற்பா (மெய்ப்பாட்டியல் 9)."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "According to Tholkappiyam, which four virtues give rise to 'Perumidham' (heroic pride/dignity)?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "Old age, sickness, distress, fragility", "B": "Kalvi (Learning), Tharugan (Fearlessness), Isaimai (Fame), Kodai (Charity)", "C": "Novelty, greatness, baseness, prosperity", "D": "Fear, anger, ridicule, wonder"}, "explanation": "Tholkappiyar defines learning, valour/courage, fame/reputation, and generosity/charity as the four origins of Perumidham."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "B", "accepted_keys": ["B"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educa