{"id": "12th_tamil_mp2_q1792", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "multiple_choice", "level": "hard", "difficulty": "hard", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "12", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "megapack_2", "lesson_id": "synoptic_mock_1", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "meyppattiyal_marutkai", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "தொல்காப்பிய மெய்ப்பாட்டியலில் 'மருட்கை' (வியப்பு) தோன்றுவதற்குரிய நான்கு களங்களாகக் கூறப்படுபவை எவை?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "மூப்பு, பிணி, வருத்தம், மென்மை", "B": "கல்வி, தறுகண், இசைமை, கொடை", "C": "அச்சம், வெகுளி, நகை, அழுகை", "D": "புதுமை, பெருமை, சிறுமை, ஆக்கம்"}, "explanation": "'புதுமை பெருமை சிறுமை ஆக்கமொடு மதியா மருட்கை நான்கு என மொழிப' என்பது தொல்காப்பிய நூற்பா (மெய்ப்பாட்டியல் 6)."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "According to Tholkappiyam, which four causes generate 'Marutkai' (wonder/astonishment)?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "Old age, sickness, distress, fragility", "B": "Learning, bravery, fame, charity", "C": "Fear, anger, laughter, grief", "D": "Pudhumai (Novelty), Perumai (Immensity), Sirumai (Minuteness), Aakkam (Miraculous creation)"}, "explanation": "Tholkappiyar identifies novelty, grand scale, extreme minuteness, and magnificent transformation as the 4 causes of Marutkai."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "D", "accepted_keys": ["D"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Edu