{"id": "12th_tamil_mp2_q1701", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "multiple_choice", "level": "hard", "difficulty": "hard", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "12", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "megapack_2", "lesson_id": "synoptic_mock_2", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "silappathikaram_thalaikkol_origin", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "சிலப்பதிகாரத்தில் ஆடலரசியான மாதவிக்கு வழங்கப்பட்ட தலைக்கோல் யாருடைய மகனான சயந்தன் சாபம் பெற்ற வடிவம் எனக் கருதப்படுகிறது?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "இந்திரன்", "B": "வருணன்", "C": "குபேரன்", "D": "சூரியன்"}, "explanation": "இந்திரன் மகனாகிய சயந்தன் அகத்தியரின் சாபத்தால் மூங்கிலாகப் பிறந்தான் என்பது புராணத் தொன்மம். அந்த மூங்கிலே தலைக்கோலாகச் செய்யப்பட்டது."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "In Silappathikaram lore, the sacred dancing rod (Thalaikkol) is mythologically held as the cursed incarnation of Jayanta, son of which deity?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "Indra", "B": "Varuna", "C": "Kubera", "D": "Surya"}, "explanation": "Jayanta, son of Indra, was mythologically transformed into a bamboo reed by Agastya's curse, from which Thalaikkol was fashioned."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "A", "accepted_keys": ["A"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "12", "term": "full_year", "edition": "2024-2025", "page": 129, "chapter": null, "section": n