{"id": "12th_tamil_mp2_q1814", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "multiple_choice", "level": "medium", "difficulty": "medium", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "12", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "megapack_2", "lesson_id": "synoptic_mock_2", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "silappathikaram_instruments_types", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "சிலப்பதிகார அரங்கேற்று காதையில் குறிப்பிடப்படும் நால்வகை இசைக்கருவிகளுள் 'முழவு, மத்தளம்' ஆகியவை எந்த வகையைச் சேர்ந்தவை?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "துளைக்கருவிகள்", "B": "தோற்கருவிகள்", "C": "நரம்புக்கருவிகள்", "D": "கஞ்சக்கருவிகள்"}, "explanation": "தோலினால் போர்த்தப்பட்டு வாசிக்கப்படும் முழவு, மத்தளம், இடக்கை ஆகியவை தோற்கருவிகள் எனப்படும்."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "In Silappathikaram's classification of musical instruments, to which class do Muzhavu and Maddhalam belong?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "Aerophones (Wind/Flutes)", "B": "Membranophones (Skin/Leather percussion)", "C": "Chordophones (Strings)", "D": "Idiophones (Cymbals/Bells)"}, "explanation": "Percussion drums wrapped in leather like Muzhavu and Maddhalam are classified as Membranophones (Thorkaruvi)."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "B", "accepted_keys": ["B"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "12", "term": "full_year", "edition": "2024-2025", "page": 131, "cha