{"id": "12th_tamil_mp2_q1836", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "multiple_choice", "level": "medium", "difficulty": "medium", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "12", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "megapack_2", "lesson_id": "synoptic_mock_3", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "kuriyedu_sangam_ullurai", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "தொல்காப்பியர் கூறும் 'உள்ளுறை உவமம்' என்பது நவீன இலக்கியத்தில் எதற்கு இணையான மரபாகும்?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "படிமம்", "B": "தொன்மம்", "C": "சிலேடை", "D": "குறியீடு (Symbol)"}, "explanation": "சங்க இலக்கியத்தில் வெளிப்படையாகக் கூறாமல் கருப்பொருட்களின் வழியாக உள்ளர்த்தத்தை உணர்த்தும் உள்ளுறை உவமம் நவீன இலக்கியக் குறியீட்டு உத்திக்கு முன்னோடியாகும்."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "In classical Tamil poetics, Tholkappiyar's concept of 'Ullurai Uvamam' directly anticipates which modern literary device?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "Padimam (Imagery)", "B": "Thonmam (Myth)", "C": "Siledai (Pun)", "D": "Kuriyedu (Symbolism)"}, "explanation": "Tholkappiyar's 'Ullurai Uvamam' directly anticipated modern literary symbolism (Kuriyedu)."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "D", "accepted_keys": ["D"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "12", "term": "full_year", "edition": "2024-2025", "page": 172, "chapter": null, "section": null, "reference": "12th Tami