{"id": "12th_tamil_mp2_q1855", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "multiple_choice", "level": "medium", "difficulty": "medium", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "12", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "megapack_2", "lesson_id": "grammar_poetics_masterclass", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "pagupadham_analysis_arindhanan", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "‘அறிந்தனன்’ - பகுபத உறுப்பிலக்கணத்தில் ‘அன்’ என்பது முறையே எவற்றைக் குறிக்கும்?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "பகுதி, விகுதி", "B": "இடைநிலை, விகுதி", "C": "சாரியை மற்றும் ஆண்பால் வினைமுற்று விகுதி", "D": "சந்தி, சாரியை"}, "explanation": "அறி + த்(ந்) + த் + அன் + அன்: இதில் முதல் 'அன்' சாரியை; இறுதி 'அன்' படர்க்கை ஆண்பால் வினைமுற்று விகுதி."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "In the morphological parsing of 'Arindhanan' (அறி + த்(ந்) + த் + அன் + அன்), what do the 'an' morphemes represent?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "Root and Suffix", "B": "Tense infix and Suffix", "C": "Euphonic augment (Saariyai) and masculine singular verbal suffix", "D": "Sandhi and Augment"}, "explanation": "The pen-ultimate 'an' functions as Saariyai (euphonic inflection) and the final 'an' is the masculine singular third-person suffix."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "C", "accepted_keys": ["C"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "12", "term": "full_year",