{"id": "12th_tamil_mp2_q1857", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "multiple_choice", "level": "medium", "difficulty": "medium", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "12", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "megapack_2", "lesson_id": "grammar_poetics_masterclass", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "meyppattiyal_uvagai", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "தொல்காப்பிய மெய்ப்பாட்டியலின்படி 'உவகை' (மகிழ்ச்சி) தோன்றுவதற்குரிய நான்கு களங்கள் எவை?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "செல்வம், புலன், புணர்வு, விளையாட்டு", "B": "கல்வி, தறுகண், இசைமை, கொடை", "C": "மூப்பு, பிணி, வருத்தம், மென்மை", "D": "புதுமை, பெருமை, சிறுமை, ஆக்கம்"}, "explanation": "'செல்வம் புலனே புணர்வு விளையாட்டென அல்லல் நீத்த உவகை நான்கே' என்பது தொல்காப்பிய நூற்பா (மெய்ப்பாட்டியல் 11)."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "According to Tholkappiyam, which four domains give rise to 'Uvagai' (joy/delight)?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "Selvam (Wealth), Pulan (Sensory gratification), Punarvu (Union of lovers), Vilaiyaattu (Play/Recreation)", "B": "Learning, bravery, fame, charity", "C": "Old age, sickness, sorrow, fragility", "D": "Novelty, greatness, smallness, prosperity"}, "explanation": "Tholkappiyar specifies prosperity/wealth, sensory pleasure, romantic reunion, and playful recreation as the 4 sources of joy."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "A", "accepted_keys": ["A"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "12", "term": "full_year", "edition": "2024-2025", "page": 138, "chapter": null, "section": null, "reference": "12th Tamil, Unit megapack_2, Page 138", "url": null, "source_notes": null}, "previous_year": {"is_previous_year": false, "exam": null, "exam_name": null, "year": null, "paper": null, "session": null}, "media": {"has_media": false, "items": []}, "tags": ["Class 12", "MegaPack 2", "Mock 4", "Meyppattiyal"], "language_status": {"ta": "available", "en": "available"}, "workflow": {"status": "published", "verification_status": "verified", "created_by": "admin", "created_at": "2026-11-05T12:00:00Z", "updated_at": "2026-11-05T12:00:00Z"}, "version": {"current": 1, "previous_version_id": null, "revision_reason": null}}
{"id": "12th_tamil_mp2_q1858", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "multiple_choice", "level": "medium", "difficulty": "medium", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "12", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "megapack_2", "lesson_id": "grammar_poetics_masterclass", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "thonmam_types_cultural", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "புதுக்கவிதையில் 'அகலிகை' என்ற பாத்திரம் எதனை உணர்த்தும் தொன்மமாகப் பயன்படுத்தப்படுகிறது?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "தியாகத்தின் சின்னம்", "B": "பெண்ணின் மீதான சமூக அநீதி மற்றும் கல்லாக்கப்பட்ட மௌனம்", "C": "வீரத்தின் அடையாளம்", "D": "செல்வச் செழிப்பு"}, "explanation": "நவீனத் தமிழ்க் கவிதைகளில் அகலிகை சாபத்தால் கல்லானது, ஆணாதிக்கச் சமூகம் பெண்ணின் குரலையும் உணர்வுகளையும் மழுங்கடித்துக் கல்லாக்கியதைக் குறிக்கும் தொன்மமாகும்."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "In modern Tamil poetry, the mythological character 'Ahalya' is predominantly employed as an archetype representing?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "Symbol of charity", "B": "Patriarchal injustice and silenced petrified womanhood", "C": "Symbol of martial bravery", "D": "Material abundance"}, "explanation": "Ahalya petrified into stone symbolizes female oppression and silencing under orthodox patriarchal systems."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "B", "accepted_keys": ["B"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "12", "term": "full_year", "edition": "2024-2025", "page": 140, "chapter": null, "section": null, "reference": "12th Tamil, Unit megapack_2, Page 140", "url": null, "source_notes": null}, "previous_year": {"is_previous_year": false, "exam": null, "exam_name": null, "year": null, "paper": null, "session": null}, "media": {"has_media": false, "items": []}, "tags": ["Class 12", "MegaPack 2", "Mock 4", "Thonmam Analysis"], "language_status": {"ta": "available", "en": "available"}, "workflow": {"status": "published", "verification_status": "verified", "created_by": "admin", "created_at": "2026-11-05T12:00:00Z", "updated_at": "2026-11-05T12:00:00Z"}, "version": {"current": 1, "previous_version_id": null, "revision_reason": null}}
{"id": "12th_tamil_mp2_q1859", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "multiple_choice", "level": "medium", "difficulty": "medium", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "12", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "megapack_2", "lesson_id": "grammar_poetics_masterclass", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "padimam_types_visual_action", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "‘வெயிலில் காயும் மிளகாய் வற்றல் போலச் சிவந்து கிடந்தன சுடுமணல் பாதைகள்’ - இதில் அமைந்துள்ள படிமம் எது?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "சுவைப் படிமம்", "B": "கேட்டல் படிமம்", "C": "காட்சிப் படிமம் (Visual Image)", "D": "தொடு உணர்வுப் படிமம்"}, "explanation": "சுடுமணல் பாதைகளின் சிவந்த தன்மையை மிளகாய் வற்றலோடு ஒப்பிட்டு மனக்கண் முன் செந்நிறக் காட்சியைத் தீட்டுவதால் இது காட்சிப் படிமம் ஆகும்."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "'The scorching sandy tracks lay red like sundried dried chillies' - Which type of image is evoked?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "Gustatory image", "B": "Auditory image", "C": "Visual Image (Kaatchip Padimam)", "D": "Tactile image"}, "explanation": "Depicting glowing fiery red earth brings a vibrant visual landscape before the mind, constituting a visual image."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "C", "accepted_keys": ["C"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "12", "term": "full_year", "edition": "2024-2025", "page": 115, "chapter": null, "section": null, "reference": "12th Tamil, Unit megapack_2, Page 115", "url": null, "source_notes": null}, "previous_year": {"is_previous_year": false, "exam": null, "exam_name": null, "year": null, "paper": null, "session": null}, "media": {"has_media": false, "items": []}, "tags": ["Class 12", "MegaPack 2", "Mock 4", "Padimam Poetics"], "language_status": {"ta": "available", "en": "available"}, "workflow": {"status": "published", "verification_status": "verified", "created_by": "admin", "created_at": "2026-11-05T12:00:00Z", "updated_at": "2026-11-05T12:00:00Z"}, "version": {"current": 1, "previous_version_id": null, "revision_reason": null}}
{"id": "12th_tamil_mp2_q1860", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "multiple_choice", "level": "medium", "difficulty": "medium", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "12", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "megapack_2", "lesson_id": "grammar_poetics_masterclass", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "kuriyedu_animal_motifs", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "சங்க இலக்கியத்தில் தலைவனின் வஞ்சனையற்ற வீரத்திற்கும் பெருந்தன்மைக்கும் குறியீடாக அமையும் விலங்கு எது?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "மான்", "B": "நரி", "C": "முதலை", "D": "சிங்கம் அல்லது யானை"}, "explanation": "சங்கப் பாடல்களில் வேங்கைப்புலி, சிங்கம், களிறு (யானை) ஆகியவை தலைவனின் கம்பீரத்திற்கும் அஞ்சா நெஞ்சத்திற்கும் குறியீடாகப் பாடப்படுகின்றன."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "In classical Sangam poetics, which animal serves as a symbolic motif for noble majestic heroism?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "Deer", "B": "Fox", "C": "Crocodile", "D": "Lion or Majestic Tusker (Elephant)"}, "explanation": "Lions and powerful bull elephants traditionally symbolize the unyielding majesty and nobility of the hero."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "D", "accepted_keys": ["D"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "12", "term": "full_year", "edition": "2024-2025", "page": 173, "chapter": null, "section": null, "reference": "12th Tamil, Unit megapack_2, Page 173", "url": null, "source_notes": null}, "previous_year": {"is_previous_year": false, "exam": null, "exam_name": null, "year": null, "paper": null, "session": null}, "media": {"has_media": false, "items": []}, "tags": ["Class 12", "MegaPack 2", "Mock 4", "Symbolism Poetics"], "language_status": {"ta": "available", "en": "available"}, "workflow": {"status": "published", "verification_status": "verified", "created_by": "admin", "created_at": "2026-11-05T12:00:00Z", "updated_at": "2026-11-05T12:00:00Z"}, "version": {"current": 1, "previous_version_id": null, "revision_reason": null}}
{"id": "12th_tamil_mp2_q1861", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "multiple_choice", "level": "medium", "difficulty": "medium", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "12", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "megapack_2", "lesson_id": "grammar_poetics_masterclass", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "punarchi_alvari_vallinam", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "அல்வழிப் புணர்ச்சியில் 'பூ + கொடி' என்பது எவ்வாறு புணரும்?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "பூங்கொடி (மெல்லினம் மிகுதல்)", "B": "பூக்கொடி", "C": "பூகொடி", "D": "பூச்செடி"}, "explanation": "'பூப்பெயர் முன் இன மென்மையும் தோன்றும்' என்ற விதிப்படி 'பூ + கொடி = பூங்கொடி' என மெல்லின மெய் தோன்றிப் புணரும்."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "Under Nannool sandhi rule 'Pooppeyar mun ina menmaiyum thondrum', how does 'Poo + Kodi' combine?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "Poongodi (nasal gemination)", "B": "Pookkodi", "C": "Pookodi", "D": "Poochedi"}, "explanation": "'Poo' induces nasal homorganic assimilation -> Poo + Kodi becomes Poongodi."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "A", "accepted_keys": ["A"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "12", "term": "full_year", "edition": "2024-2025", "page": 42, "chapter": null, "section": null, "reference": "12th Tamil, Unit megapack_2, Page 42", "url": null, "source_notes": null}, "previous_year": {"is_previous_year": false, "exam": null, "exam_name": null, "year": null, "paper": null, "session": null}, "media": {"has_media": false, "items": []}, "tags": ["Class 12", "MegaPack 2", "Mock 4", "Sandhi Punarchi"], "language_status": {"ta": "available", "en": "available"}, "workflow": {"status": "published", "verification_status": "verified", "created_by": "admin", "created_at": "2026-11-05T12:00:00Z", "updated_at": "2026-11-05T12:00:00Z"}, "version": {"current": 1, "previous_version_id": null, "revision_reason": null}}
{"id": "12th_tamil_mp2_q1862", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "multiple_choice", "level": "medium", "difficulty": "medium", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "12", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "megapack_2", "lesson_id": "grammar_poetics_masterclass", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "porul_mayakkam_case_marker", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "வேற்றுமை உருபுகளைத் தவறான இடத்தில் இணைப்பதால் ஏற்படும் தவறுக்குச் சரியான சான்று எது?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "மகன் தந்தைக்கு எழுதினான்", "B": "அப்பாவின் சட்டையைத் தம்பி போட்டுக் கொண்டான்", "C": "அவன் பாடம் படித்தான்", "D": "மரங்கள் காற்றில் அசைந்தன"}, "explanation": "'அப்பாவின் சட்டையைத் தம்பி போட்டுக் கொண்டான்' என்பதை 'அப்பா சட்டையைத் தம்பி போட்டுக் கொண்டான்' என்று எழுதினால் பொருள் மாறுபடும்; வேற்றுமை உருபு தவறினால் பொருள் மயங்கும்."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "Which of the following clarifies proper case marker placement preventing ambiguity?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "Son wrote to father", "B": "Thambi put on Appa's shirt (proper genitive & accusative placement)", "C": "He read lesson", "D": "Trees swayed in wind"}, "explanation": "Proper application of genitive ('-in') and accusative ('-ai') markers avoids syntactic and semantic ambiguity."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "B", "accepted_keys": ["B"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "12", "term": "full_year", "edition": "2024-2025", "page": 68, "chapter": null, "section": null, "reference": "12th Tamil, Unit megapack_2, Page 68", "url": null, "source_notes": null}, "previous_year": {"is_previous_year": false, "exam": null, "exam_name": null, "year": null, "paper": null, "session": null}, "media": {"has_media": false, "items": []}, "tags": ["Class 12", "MegaPack 2", "Mock 4", "Porul Mayakkam"], "language_status": {"ta": "available", "en": "available"}, "workflow": {"status": "published", "verification_status": "verified", "created_by": "admin", "created_at": "2026-11-05T12:00:00Z", "updated_at": "2026-11-05T12:00:00Z"}, "version": {"current": 1, "previous_version_id": null, "revision_reason": null}}
{"id": "12th_tamil_mp2_q1863", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "multiple_choice", "level": "medium", "difficulty": "medium", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "12", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "megapack_2", "lesson_id": "grammar_poetics_masterclass", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "meyppattiyal_veguli_origins", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "தொல்காப்பிய மெய்ப்பாட்டியலில் 'வெகுளி' (கோபம்/சினம்) தோன்றுவதற்குரிய நான்கு காரணங்கள் எவை?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "செல்வம், புலன், புணர்வு, விளையாட்டு", "B": "கல்வி, தறுகண், இசைமை, கொடை", "C": "உறுப்பறை, குடிகோள், அலை, கொலை", "D": "மூப்பு, பிணி, வருத்தம், மென்மை"}, "explanation": "'உறுப்பறை குடிகோள் அலைகொலை என்ற வெறுப்பின் வந்த வெகுளி நான்கே' என்பது தொல்காப்பிய நூற்பா (மெய்ப்பாட்டியல் 10)."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "According to Tholkappiyam, which 4 provocations trigger 'Veguli' (wrath/anger)?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "Wealth, senses, union, play", "B": "Learning, bravery, fame, charity", "C": "Urupparai (Mutilation of limbs), Kudikol (Plundering household/state), Alai (Persecution), Kolai (Murder)", "D": "Old age, sickness, distress, fragility"}, "explanation": "Tholkappiyar catalogs physical mutilation, ruinous plundering, harassment, and homicide as the four origins of wrath."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "C", "accepted_keys": ["C"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "12", "term": "full_year", "edition": "2024-2025", "page": 138, "chapter": null, "section": null, "reference": "12th Tamil, Unit megapack_2, Page 138", "url": null, "source_notes": null}, "previous_year": {"is_previous_year": false, "exam": null, "exam_name": null, "year": null, "paper": null, "session": null}, "media": {"has_media": false, "items": []}, "tags": ["Class 12", "MegaPack 2", "Mock 4", "Meyppattiyal"], "language_status": {"ta": "available", "en": "available"}, "workflow": {"status": "published", "verification_status": "verified", "created_by": "admin", "created_at": "2026-11-05T12:00:00Z", "updated_at": "2026-11-05T12:00:00Z"}, "version": {"current": 1, "previous_version_id": null, "revision_reason": null}}
{"id": "12th_tamil_mp2_q1864", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "multiple_choice", "level": "medium", "difficulty": "medium", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "12", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "megapack_2", "lesson_id": "grammar_poetics_masterclass", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "ani_ilakkanam_vekkai", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "‘தீயினால் சுட்டபுண் உள்ளாறும் ஆறாதே நாவினால் சுட்ட வடு’ - இக்குறளில் பயின்று வந்துள்ள அணி யாது?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "உவமை அணி", "B": "எடுத்துக்காட்டு உவமை அணி", "C": "வஞ்சப்புகழ்ச்சி அணி", "D": "வேற்றுமை அணி (Contrast/Difference)"}, "explanation": "தீப்புண், நாப்புண் இரண்டையும் சுடும் தன்மையால் ஒன்றுபடுத்திக் கூறி, பின்னர் நாப்புண் ஆறாது என வேற்றுமைப்படுத்திக் காட்டியதால் இது வேற்றுமை அணி ஆகும்."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "'The burn of fire heals inside; the scar caused by caustic words never heals' - Which figure of speech is employed in this Kural?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "Simile", "B": "Exemplary Simile", "C": "Irony / Camouflage Praise", "D": "Vetttrumai Ani (Antithesis/Contrast)"}, "explanation": "First drawing similarity between thermal burns and verbal burns, then contrasting that verbal wounds never heal exemplifies Vetttrumai Ani."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "D", "accepted_keys": ["D"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporat