{"id": "12th_tamil_mp2_q1874", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "multiple_choice", "level": "medium", "difficulty": "medium", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "12", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "megapack_2", "lesson_id": "grammar_poetics_masterclass", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "pagupadham_vidhai_root", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "‘விதைத்தான்’ என்னும் வினைமுற்றின் வேர்ச்சொல் (பகுதி) எது?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "விதைத்து", "B": "விதை", "C": "விதைத்த", "D": "வித்து"}, "explanation": "விதைத்தான்: விதை (பகுதி) + த் (சந்தி) + த் (இறந்தகால இடைநிலை) + ஆன் (படர்க்கை ஆண்பால் வினைமுற்று விகுதி). பகுதி 'விதை'."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "What is the root verbal base (Pakuthi) of the finite verb 'Vidhaithaan' (he sowed)?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "Vidhaithu", "B": "Vidhai (to sow)", "C": "Vidhaitha", "D": "Vitthu"}, "explanation": "The primitive imperative root of 'Vidhaithaan' is the verb base 'Vidhai'."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "B", "accepted_keys": ["B"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "12", "term": "full_year", "edition": "2024-2025", "page": 92, "chapter": null, "section": null, "reference": "12th Tamil, Unit megapack_2, Page 92", "url": null, "source_notes": null}, "previous_year": {"is_previous_year": false, "exam": null, "exam_name": null, "ye