{"id": "12th_tamil_mp2_q1905", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "multiple_choice", "level": "hard", "difficulty": "hard", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "12", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "megapack_2", "lesson_id": "high_order_masterclass", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "assertion_reasoning_sculptures", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "கூற்று (A): மாமல்லபுரக் கடற்கரைக் கோயில் கட்டுமானக் கோயில்களுக்குச் சிறந்த சான்றாகும்.\nகாரணம் (R): பல்லவர்கள் காலத்தில் பாறைகளைக் குடைந்து அமைக்கும் குடைவரைக் கோயில் முறையிலிருந்து கற்களை ஒன்றன்மீது ஒன்றாக அடுக்கி அமைக்கும் கட்டுமானக் கோயில் கலை வளர்ந்தது.", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "கூற்று (A) மற்றும் காரணம் (R) இரண்டும் சரி; காரணம் கூற்றை மிகச் சரியாக விளக்குகிறது.", "B": "கூற்று (A) சரி, ஆனால் காரணம் (R) தவறு.", "C": "கூற்று (A) தவறு, ஆனால் காரணம் (R) சரி.", "D": "கூற்று (A) மற்றும் காரணம் (R) இரண்டும் தவறு."}, "explanation": "மாமல்லபுரக் கடற்கரைக் கோயில் இரண்டாம் நரசிம்மவர்மன் (இராஜசிம்மன்) காலத்தில் உருவான அழகிய கட்டுமானக் கோயிலாகும்; கூற்றும் காரணமும் முற்றிலும் சரியானவை."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "Assertion (A): The Shore Temple at Mamallapuram is a prime specimen of structural stone temple architecture.\nReason (R): Under the later Pallavas, rock-cut architecture evolved into structural stone temples constructed by dressing and stacking granite blocks.", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "Both Assertion (A) and Reason (R) are correct; Reason correctly explains Assertion.", "B": "Assertion (A) is correct, but Reason (R) is false.", "C": "Assertion (A) is false, but Reason (R) is correct.", "D": "Both Assertion (A) and Reason (R) are false."}, "explanation": "Both Assertion and Reason are historically accurate, demonstrating the shift from rock excavating to structural granite masonry."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "A", "accepted_keys": ["A"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "12", "term": "full_year", "edition": "2024-2025", "page": 124, "chapter": null, "section": null, "reference": "12th Tamil, Unit megapack_2, Page 124", "url": null, "source_notes": null}, "previous_year": {"is_previous_year": false, "exam": null, "exam_name": null, "year": null, "paper": null, "session": null}, "media": {"has_media": false, "items": []}, "tags": ["Class 12", "MegaPack 2", "Mock 6", "Assertion Reason"], "language_status": {"ta": "available", "en": "available"}, "workflow": {"status": "published", "verification_status": "verified", "created_by": "admin", "created_at": "2026-11-05T12:00:00Z", "updated_at": "2026-11-05T12:00:00Z"}, "version": {"current": 1, "previous_version_id": null, "revision_reason": null}}
{"id": "12th_tamil_mp2_q1906", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "multiple_choice", "level": "hard", "difficulty": "hard", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "12", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "megapack_2", "lesson_id": "high_order_masterclass", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "matching_meyppadu_triggers", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "பொருத்துக (மெய்ப்பாடுகள் - தோன்றும் களங்கள்):\n(1) நகை - (i) மூப்பு, பிணி, வருத்தம், மென்மை\n(2) அழுகை - (ii) எள்ளல், இளமை, பேதைமை, மடன்\n(3) இளிவரல் - (iii) இழிவு, இழவு, அசைவு, வறுமை\n(4) பெருமிதம் - (iv) கல்வி, தறுகண், இசைமை, கொடை", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "(1)-(i), (2)-(ii), (3)-(iii), (4)-(iv)", "B": "(1)-(ii), (2)-(iii), (3)-(i), (4)-(iv)", "C": "(1)-(iii), (2)-(i), (3)-(iv), (4)-(ii)", "D": "(1)-(iv), (2)-(iii), (3)-(ii), (4)-(i)"}, "explanation": "தொல்காப்பிய மெய்ப்பாட்டியலின்படி: நகை = எள்ளல், இளமை, பேதைமை, மடன்; அழுகை = இழிவு, இழவு, அசைவு, வறுமை; இளிவரல் = மூப்பு, பிணி, வருத்தம், மென்மை; பெருமிதம் = கல்வி, தறுகண், இசைமை, கொடை."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "Match the aesthetic emotions (Meyppadu) with their canonical four triggers according to Tholkappiyam:\n(1) Nagai - (i) Mooppu, Pini, Varuttham, Menmai\n(2) Azhugai - (ii) Ellal, Ilamai, Pethaimai, Madan\n(3) Ilivaral - (iii) Izhivu, Izhavu, Asaivu, Varumai\n(4) Perumidham - (iv) Kalvi, Tharugan, Isaimai, Kodai", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "(1)-(i), (2)-(ii), (3)-(iii), (4)-(iv)", "B": "(1)-(ii), (2)-(iii), (3)-(i), (4)-(iv)", "C": "(1)-(iii), (2)-(i), (3)-(iv), (4)-(ii)", "D": "(1)-(iv), (2)-(iii), (3)-(ii), (4)-(i)"}, "explanation": "Matching: Nagai-(ii), Azhugai-(iii), Ilivaral-(i), Perumidham-(iv). Correct sequence is B."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "B", "accepted_keys": ["B"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "12", "term": "full_year", "edition": "2024-2025", "page": 138, "chapter": null, "section": null, "reference": "12th Tamil, Unit megapack_2, Page 138", "url": null, "source_notes": null}, "previous_year": {"is_previous_year": false, "exam": null, "exam_name": null, "year": null, "paper": null, "session": null}, "media": {"has_media": false, "items": []}, "tags": ["Class 12", "MegaPack 2", "Mock 6", "Meyppattiyal Matching"], "language_status": {"ta": "available", "en": "available"}, "workflow": {"status": "published", "verification_status": "verified", "created_by": "admin", "created_at": "2026-11-05T12:00:00Z", "updated_at": "2026-11-05T12:00:00Z"}, "version": {"current": 1, "previous_version_id": null, "revision_reason": null}}
{"id": "12th_tamil_mp2_q1907", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "multiple_choice", "level": "hard", "difficulty": "hard", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "12", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "megapack_2", "lesson_id": "high_order_masterclass", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "statement_eval_mayilai_seeni", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "மயிலை சீனி. வேங்கடசாமி பற்றிய கீழ்க்கண்ட கூற்றுகளை ஆராய்க:\n(1) இவர் தொடக்கப்பள்ளி ஆசிரியராகப் பணியாற்றித் தம் சொந்த முயற்சியால் வரலாற்று ஆய்வாளரானார்.\n(2) இவருக்கு மதுரைப் பல்கலைக்கழகம் 'தமிழ்ப் பேரவைச் செம்மல்' என்ற பட்டம் வழங்கியது.\n(3) இவர் இயற்றிய முதல் நூல் 'மறைந்துபோன தமிழ் நூல்கள்' ஆகும்.\nஇவற்றுள் சரியான கூற்றுகள் எவை?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "(1) மற்றும் (3) மட்டுமே சரி", "B": "(2) மற்றும் (3) மட்டுமே சரி", "C": "(1) மற்றும் (2) மட்டுமே சரி", "D": "அனைத்தும் சரி"}, "explanation": "கூற்று (3) தவறானது; இவரது முதல் நூல் 'கிறித்தவமும் தமிழும்' (1936) ஆகும். எனவே (1) மற்றும் (2) மட்டுமே சரி."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "Evaluate the following statements regarding Mayilai Seeni. Venkatasamy:\n(1) He worked as an elementary school teacher and became a monumental historian through self-driven research.\n(2) Madurai Kamaraj University awarded him the title 'Thamizh Peravai Semmal'.\n(3) His maiden published book was 'Maraindhupona Thamizh Noolgal'.\nWhich statements are correct?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "(1) and (3) only", "B": "(2) and (3) only", "C": "(1) and (2) only", "D": "All are correct"}, "explanation": "Statement (3) is incorrect because his maiden published work was 'Kirithavamum Thamizhum' (1936). Statements (1) and (2) are correct."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "C", "accepted_keys": ["C"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "12", "term": "full_year", "edition": "2024-2025", "page": 161, "chapter": null, "section": null, "reference": "12th Tamil, Unit megapack_2, Page 161", "url": null, "source_notes": null}, "previous_year": {"is_previous_year": false, "exam": null, "exam_name": null, "year": null, "paper": null, "session": null}, "media": {"has_media": false, "items": []}, "tags": ["Class 12", "MegaPack 2", "Mock 6", "Mayilai Seeni Statements"], "language_status": {"ta": "available", "en": "available"}, "workflow": {"status": "published", "verification_status": "verified", "created_by": "admin", "created_at": "2026-11-05T12:00:00Z", "updated_at": "2026-11-05T12:00:00Z"}, "version": {"current": 1, "previous_version_id": null, "revision_reason": null}}
{"id": "12th_tamil_mp2_q1908", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "multiple_choice", "level": "hard", "difficulty": "hard", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "12", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "megapack_2", "lesson_id": "high_order_masterclass", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "matching_kadaiyezhu_vallalgal", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "பொருத்துக (கடையேழு வள்ளல்கள் - கொடைச் சிறப்புகள்):\n(1) பேகன் - (i) முல்லைக்குத் தேர் ஈந்தவன்\n(2) பாரி - (ii) மயிலுக்குப் போர்வை ஈந்தவன்\n(3) காரி - (iii) இரவலர்க்குக் குதிரைகளையும் நாட்டையும் ஈந்தவன்\n(4) ஆய் - (iv) நீல நாகத்தின் ஆடையை இறைவனுக்கு அணிவித்தவன்", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "(1)-(i), (2)-(ii), (3)-(iii), (4)-(iv)", "B": "(1)-(iii), (2)-(i), (3)-(ii), (4)-(iv)", "C": "(1)-(iv), (2)-(iii), (3)-(ii), (4)-(i)", "D": "(1)-(ii), (2)-(i), (3)-(iii), (4)-(iv)"}, "explanation": "பேகன் மயிலுக்குப் போர்வை ஈந்தான்; பாரி முல்லைக்குத் தேர் ஈந்தான்; காரி இரவலர்க்குக் குதிரைகளையும் நாட்டையும் ஈந்தான்; ஆய் நாகத்தின் ஆடையை இறைவனுக்கு ஈந்தான். சரியான வரிசை: D."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "Match the Sangam Munificent Patrons with their philanthropic legends:\n(1) Pegan - (i) Offered chariot to jasmine creeper\n(2) Paari - (ii) Gifted royal mantle to shivering peacock\n(3) Kaari - (iii) Gifted war steeds and realms to bards\n(4) Aay - (iv) Gifted radiant blue serpent robe to Lord Shiva", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "(1)-(i), (2)-(ii), (3)-(iii), (4)-(iv)", "B": "(1)-(iii), (2)-(i), (3)-(ii), (4)-(iv)", "C": "(1)-(iv), (2)-(iii), (3)-(ii), (4)-(i)", "D": "(1)-(ii), (2)-(i), (3)-(iii), (4)-(iv)"}, "explanation": "Matching: Pegan-(ii), Paari-(i), Kaari-(iii), Aay-(iv). Correct match is D."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "D", "accepted_keys": ["D"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "12", "term": "full_year", "edition": "2024-2025", "page": 166, "chapter": null, "section": null, "reference": "12th Tamil, Unit megapack_2, Page 166", "url": null, "source_notes": null}, "previous_year": {"is_previous_year": false, "exam": null, "exam_name": null, "year": null, "paper": null, "session": null}, "media": {"has_media": false, "items": []}, "tags": ["Class 12", "MegaPack 2", "Mock 6", "Vallalgal Matching"], "language_status": {"ta": "available", "en": "available"}, "workflow": {"status": "published", "verification_status": "verified", "created_by": "admin", "created_at": "2026-11-05T12:00:00Z", "updated_at": "2026-11-05T12:00:00Z"}, "version": {"current": 1, "previous_version_id": null, "revision_reason": null}}
{"id": "12th_tamil_mp2_q1909", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "multiple_choice", "level": "hard", "difficulty": "hard", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "12", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "megapack_2", "lesson_id": "high_order_masterclass", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "assertion_reasoning_silappathikaram", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "கூற்று (A): சிலப்பதிகாரம் 'முத்தமிழ்க் காப்பியம்' என்றும், 'குடிமக்கள் காப்பியம்' என்றும் போற்றப்படுகிறது.\nகாரணம் (R): அரச குடும்பத்து இளவரசனைத் தலைவனாகக் கொள்ளாமல் எளிய வணிகக் குடும்பத்துக் கோவலன் மற்றும் கண்ணகியை முதன்மைக் கதாபாத்திரங்களாகக் கொண்டு இயற்றப்பட்டதால் இது குடிமக்கள் காப்பியம் எனப்படுகிறது.", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "கூற்று (A) மற்றும் காரணம் (R) இரண்டும் சரி; காரணம் கூற்றை மிகச் சரியாக விளக்குகிறது.", "B": "கூற்று (A) சரி, ஆனால் காரணம் (R) தவறு.", "C": "கூற்று (A) தவறு, ஆனால் காரணம் (R) சரி.", "D": "கூற்று (A) மற்றும் காரணம் (R) இரண்டும் தவறு."}, "explanation": "மன்னர்களை மட்டுமே பாடிய மரபை மாற்றி எளிய மனிதர்களைக் காப்பியத் தலைவர்களாக ஏற்றியதால் இளங்கோவடிகளின் சிலப்பதிகாரம் 'குடிமக்கள் காப்பியம்' எனப்படுகிறது; கூற்றும் காரணமும் சரி."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "Assertion (A): Silappathikaram is revered as 'Muttamizh Kaappiyam' and 'Kudimakkal Kaappiyam' (Epic of the Common Folk).\nReason (R): Unlike traditional epics eulogizing royal monarchs, it elevated a common merchant youth Kovalan and maiden Kannagi as epic protagonists.", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "Both Assertion (A) and Reason (R) are correct; Reason correctly explains Assertion.", "B": "Assertion (A) is correct, but Reason (R) is false.", "C": "Assertion (A) is false, but Reason (R) is correct.", "D": "Both Assertion (A) and Reason (R) are false."}, "explanation": "Both Assertion and Reason are fully valid, highlighting the democratic social innovation of Silappathikaram."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "A", "accepted_keys": ["A"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "12", "term": "full_year", "edition": "2024-2025", "page": 128, "chapter": null, "section": null, "reference": "12th Tamil, Unit megapack_2, Page 128", "url": null, "source_notes": null}, "previous_year": {"is_previous_year": false, "exam": null, "exam_name": null, "year": null, "paper": null, "session": null}, "media": {"has_media": false, "items": []}, "tags": ["Class 12", "MegaPack 2", "Mock 6", "Silappathikaram Assertion"], "language_status": {"ta": "available", "en": "available"}, "workflow": {"status": "published", "verification_status": "verified", "created_by": "admin", "created_at": "2026-11-05T12:00:00Z", "updated_at": "2026-11-05T12:00:00Z"}, "version": {"current": 1, "previous_version_id": null, "revision_reason": null}}
{"id": "12th_tamil_mp2_q1910", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "multiple_choice", "level": "hard", "difficulty": "hard", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "12", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "megapack_2", "lesson_id": "high_order_masterclass", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "matching_authors_special_titles", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "பொருத்துக (தமிழ் ஆளுமைகள் - சிறப்புப் பெயர்கள்):\n(1) எச்.ஏ. கிருஷ்ணபிள்ளை - (i) உவமைக் கவிஞர்\n(2) சுரதா - (ii) கிறித்துவக் கம்பன்\n(3) உ.வே. சாமிநாதையர் - (iii) தமிழ்ப் பேரவைச் செம்மல்\n(4) மயிலை சீனி. வேங்கடசாமி - (iv) தமிழ்த்தாத்தா", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "(1)-(i), (2)-(ii), (3)-(iii), (4)-(iv)", "B": "(1)-(ii), (2)-(i), (3)-(iv), (4)-(iii)", "C": "(1)-(iii), (2)-(iv), (3)-(i), (4)-(ii)", "D": "(1)-(iv), (2)-(iii), (3)-(ii), (4)-(i)"}, "explanation": "எச்.ஏ. கிருஷ்ணபிள்ளை = கிறித்துவக் கம்பன்; சுரதா = உவமைக் கவிஞர்; உ.வே.சா = தமிழ்த்தாத்தா; மயிலை சீனி. வேங்கடசாமி = தமிழ்ப் பேரவைச் செம்மல். சரியான வரிசை: B."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "Match the eminent literary stalwarts with their historic titles:\n(1) H.A. Krishna Pillai - (i) Uvamaik Kavignar\n(2) Suradha - (ii) Kirithuvak Kambar\n(3) U.V. Swaminatha Iyer - (iii) Thamizh Peravai Semmal\n(4) Mayilai Seeni. Venkatasamy - (iv) Tamizhppaatta", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "(1)-(i), (2)-(ii), (3)-(iii), (4)-(iv)", "B": "(1)-(ii), (2)-(i), (3)-(iv), (4)-(iii)", "C": "(1)-(iii), (2)-(iv), (3)-(i), (4)-(ii)", "D": "(1)-(iv), (2)-(iii), (3)-(ii), (4)-(i)"}, "explanation": "Matching: Krishna Pillai-(ii), Suradha-(i), U.Ve.Sa-(iv), Mayilai Seeni-(iii). Correct choice is B."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "B", "accepted_keys": ["B"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "12", "term": "full_year", "edition": "2024-2025", "page": 168, "chapter": null, "section": null, "reference": "12th Tamil, Unit megapack_2, Page 168", "url": null, "source_notes": null}, "previous_year": {"is_previous_year": false, "exam": null, "exam_name": null, "year": null, "paper": null, "session": null}, "media": {"has_media": false, "items": []}, "tags": ["Class 12", "MegaPack 2", "Mock 6", "Title Matching"], "language_status": {"ta": "available", "en": "available"}, "workflow": {"status": "published", "verification_status": "verified", "created_by": "admin", "created_at": "2026-11-05T12:00:00Z", "updated_at": "2026-11-05T12:00:00Z"}, "version": {"current": 1, "previous_version_id": null, "revision_reason": null}}
{"id": "12th_tamil_mp2_q1911", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "multiple_choice", "level": "hard", "difficulty": "hard", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "12", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "megapack_2", "lesson_id": "high_order_masterclass", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "statement_eval_ratchanya_yaathirigam", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "இரட்சணிய யாத்திரிகம் பற்றிய கீழ்க்கண்ட கூற்றுகளை ஆராய்க:\n(1) இந்நூல் ஜான் பனியனின் 'The Pilgrim's Progress' நூலைத் தழுவி எழுதப்பட்டது.\n(2) இந்நூலில் 5 பருவங்களும் 3766 பாடல்களும் அமைந்துள்ளன.\n(3) இதன் ஆசிரியர் வீரமாமுனிவர் ஆவார்.\nஇவற்றுள் சரியான கூற்றுகள் எவை?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "(1) மற்றும் (3) மட்டுமே சரி", "B": "(2) மற்றும் (3) மட்டுமே சரி", "C": "(1) மற்றும் (2) மட்டுமே சரி", "D": "அனைத்தும் சரி"}, "explanation": "கூற்று (3) தவறானது; இரட்சணிய யாத்திரிகத்தின் ஆசிரியர் எச்.ஏ. கிருஷ்ணபிள்ளை ஆவார் (வீரமாமுனிவர் தேம்பாவணியை இயற்றினார்). எனவே (1) மற்றும் (2) மட்டுமே சரி."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "Examine the following statements regarding Ratchanya Yaathirigam:\n(1) It is adapted from John Bunyan's 'The Pilgrim's Progress'.\n(2) It contains 5 Paruvams and 3,766 verses.\n(3) It was authored by Veeramamunivar.\nWhich statements are correct?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "(1) and (3) only", "B": "(2) and (3) only", "C": "(1) and (2) only", "D": "All are correct"}, "explanation": "Statement (3) is false; H.A. Krishna Pillai authored Ratchanya Yaathirigam (Veeramamunivar authored Thembavani). (1) and (2) are correct."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "C", "accepted_keys": ["C"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "12", "term": "full_year", "edition": "2024-2025", "page": 168, "chapter": null, "section": null, "reference": "12th Tamil, Unit megapack_2, Page 168", "url": null, "source_notes": null}, "previous_year": {"is_previous_year": false, "exam": null, "exam_name": null, "year": null, "paper": null, "session": null}, "media": {"has_media": false, "items": []}, "tags": ["Class 12", "MegaPack 2", "Mock 6", "Ratchanya Statements"], "language_status": {"ta": "available", "en": "available"}, "workflow": {"status": "published", "verification_status": "verified", "created_by": "admin", "created_at": "2026-11-05T12:00:00Z", "updated_at": "2026-11-05T12:00:00Z"}, "version": {"current": 1, "previous_version_id": null, "revision_reason": null}}
{"id": "12th_tamil_mp2_q1912", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "multiple_choice", "level": "hard", "difficulty": "hard", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "12", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "megapack_2", "lesson_id": "high_order_masterclass", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "chronology_tamil_commentaries", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "திருக்குறள் உரை மற்றும் பதிப்பு வரலாற்றில் கீழ்க்கண்ட நிகழ்வுகளைக் காலவரிசைப்படுத்துக:\n(1) எல்லிஸ் துரை வள்ளுவர் உருவம் பொறித்த தங்கக் காசு வெளியீடு\n(2) வீரமாமுனிவர் திருக்குறளை இலத்தீனில் மொழிபெயர்த்தல்\n(3) ஜி.யு. போப் திருக்குறளை ஆங்கிலத்தில் முழுமையாக மொழிபெயர்த்தல்\n(4) தஞ்சையில் திருக்குறள் முதன்முதலில் அச்சேறி வெளிவருதல்", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "(1) - (2) - (3) - (4)", "B": "(4) - (1) - (2) - (3)", "C": "(3) - (2) - (1) - (4)", "D": "(2) - (1) - (4) - (3)"}, "explanation": "காலவரிசை: (2) வீரமாமுனிவர் இலத்தீன் மொழிபெயர்ப்பு (1730) -> (1) எல்லிஸ் துரை தங்கக் காசு (1812) -> (4) தஞ்சை பதிப்பு (1812) -> (3) ஜி.யு. போப் ஆங்கில மொழிபெயர்ப்பு (1886). எனவே சரியான வரிசை D."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "Arrange the following landmark events in Thirukkural publication and translation in correct chronological order:\n(1) F.W. Ellis mints commemorative gold coin\n(2) Veeramamunivar translates into Latin\n(3) G.U. Pope publishes complete English translation\n(4) First Tamil print edition published at Thanjavur", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "(1) - (2) - (3) - (4)", "B": "(4) - (1) - (2) - (3)", "C": "(3) - (2) - (1) - (4)", "D": "(2) [1730] - (1) [1812] - (4) [1812] - (3) [1886]"}, "explanation": "Chronological order: Beschi's Latin translation (1730), Ellis coin (1812), Thanjavur print (1812), Pope's English translation (1886)."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "D", "accepted_keys": ["D"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "12", "term": "full_year", "edition": "2024-2025", "page": 174, "chapter": null, "section": null, "reference": "12th Tamil, Unit megapack_2, Page 174", "url": null, "source_notes": null}, "previous_year": {"is_previous_year": false, "exam": null, "exam_name": null, "year": null, "paper": null, "session": null}, "media": {"has_media": false, "items": []}, "tags": ["Class 12", "MegaPack 2", "Mock 6", "Chronology Thirukkural"], "language_status": {"ta": "available", "en": "available"}, "workflow": {"status": "published", "verification_status": "verified", "created_by": "admin", "created_at": "2026-11-05T12:00:00Z", "updated_at": "2026-11-05T12:00:00Z"}, "version": {"current": 1, "previous_version_id": null, "revision_reason": null}}
{"id": "12th_tamil_mp2_q1913", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "multiple_choice", "level": "hard", "difficulty": "hard", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "12", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "megapack_2", "lesson_id": "high_order_masterclass", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "assertion_reasoning_nammazhvar", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "கூற்று (A): இயற்கை வேளாண்மை மண்ணின் வளத்தைப் பாதுகாத்து வருங்காலத் தலைமுறையினருக்குச் சீரான சூழலை உறுதி செய்கிறது.\nகாரணம் (R): இரசாயன உரங்களும் பூச்சிக்கொல்லிகளும் நிலத்தடி நீரையும் மண்ணின் நுண்ணுயிரிகளையும் நஞ்சாக்கி நிலத்தை மலடாக்குகின்றன.", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "கூற்று (A) மற்றும் காரணம் (R) இரண்டும் சரி; காரணம் கூற்றை மிகச் சரியாக விளக்குகிறது.", "B": "கூற்று (A) சரி, ஆனால் காரணம் (R) தவறு.", "C": "கூற்று (A) தவறு, ஆனால் காரணம் (R) சரி.", "D": "கூற்று (A) மற்றும் காரணம் (R) இரண்டும் தவறு."}, "explanation": "நம்மாழ்வார் சுட்டிக்காட்டியபடி நஞ்சில்லா இயற்கை வேளாண்மை மண்ணின் நுண்ணுயிர்களைக் காக்கிறது; கூற்றும் காரணமும் முற்றிலும் சரி."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "Assertion (A): Organic ecological agriculture preserves soil fertility and sustains an unpolluted biosphere for future generations.\nReason (R): Synthetic chemical fertilizers and pesticides poison soil microorganisms, deplete groundwater, and render topsoil barren.", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "Both Assertion (A) and Reason (R) are correct; Reason correctly explains Assertion.", "B": "Assertion (A) is correct, but Reason (R) is false.", "C": "Assertion (A) is false, but Reason (R) is correct.", "D": "Both Assertion (A) and Reason (R) are false."}, "explanation": "Both Assertion and Reason are scientifically sound, elucidating Nammazhvar's agro-ecological philosophy."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "A", "accepted_keys": ["A"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "12", "term": "full_year", "edition": "2024-2025", "page": 119, "chapter": null, "section": null, "reference": "12th Tamil, Unit megapack_2, Page 119", "url": null, "source_notes": null}, "previous_year": {"is_previous_year": false, "exam": null, "exam_name": null, "year": null, "paper": null, "session": null}, "media": {"has_media": false, "items": []}, "tags": ["Class 12", "MegaPack 2", "Mock 6", "Ecology Assertion"], "language_status": {"ta": "available", "en": "available"}, "workflow": {"status": "published", "verification_status": "verified", "created_by": "admin", "created_at": "2026-11-05T12:00:00Z", "updated_at": "2026-11-05T12:00:00Z"}, "version": {"current": 1, "previous_version_id": null, "revision_reason": null}}
{"id": "12th_tamil_mp2_q1914", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "multiple_choice", "level": "hard", "difficulty": "hard", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "12", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "megapack_2", "lesson_id": "high_order_masterclass", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "matching_poetic_devices", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "பொருத்துக (இலக்கியக் கோட்பாடுகள் - விளக்கங்கள்):\n(1) படிமம் - (i) பழங்கதைகளையும் நம்பிக்கைகளையும் புதுப்பிக்கும் உத்தி\n(2) தொன்மம் - (ii) காட்சியை மனக்கண் முன் செதுக்கிக் காட்டும் உத்தி\n(3) குறியீடு - (iii) வெளிப்படையாகக் கூறாமல் அடையாளப் பொருளால் உணர்த்துதல்\n(4) மெய்ப்பாடு - (iv) உள்ளத்து உணர்வுகள் உடம்பில் புலப்படும் வெளிப்பாடு", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "(1)-(i), (2)-(ii), (3)-(iii), (4)-(iv)", "B": "(1)-(ii), (2)-(i), (3)-(iii), (4)-(iv)", "C": "(1)-(iii), (2)-(i), (3)-(iv), (4)-(ii)", "D": "(1)-(iv), (2)-(iii), (3)-(ii), (4)-(i)"}, "explanation": "படிமம் = மனக்கண் காட்சி (ii); தொன்மம் = பழங்கதை உத்தி (i); குறியீடு = அடையாளப் பொருள் உத்தி (iii); மெய்ப்பாடு = உடம்பில் வெளிப்படும் உணர்வு (iv). சரியான வரிசை B."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "Match the literary poetics concepts with their precise definitions:\n(1) Padimam - (i) Technique reinterpreting ancient mythological narratives\n(2) Thonmam - (ii) Technique projecting sensory pictures on the mental eye\n(3) Kuriyedu - (iii) Communication through symbolic representative objects\n(4) Meyppadu - (iv) Physical somatic manifest expression of inner emotions", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "(1)-(i), (2)-(ii), (3)-(iii), (4)-(iv)", "B": "(1)-(ii), (2)-(i), (3)-(iii), (4)-(iv)", "C": "(1)-(iii), (2)-(i), (3)-(iv), (4)-(ii)", "D": "(1)-(iv), (2)-(iii), (3)-(ii), (4)-(i)"}, "explanation": "Matching: Padimam-(ii), Thonmam-(i), Kuriyedu-(iii), Meyppadu-(iv). Correct match is B."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "B", "accepted_keys": ["B"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "12", "term": "full_year", "edition": "2024-2025", "page": 172, "chapter": null, "section": null, "reference": "12th Tamil, Unit megapack_2, Page 172", "url": null, "source_notes": null}, "previous_year": {"is_previous_year": false, "exam": null, "exam_name": null, "year": null, "paper": null, "session": null}, "media": {"has_media": false, "items": []}, "tags": ["Class 12", "MegaPack 2", "Mock 6", "Poetics Matching"], "language_status": {"ta": "available", "en": "available"}, "workflow": {"status": "published", "verification_status": "verified", "created_by": "admin", "created_at": "2026-11-05T12:00:00Z", "updated_at": "2026-11-05T12:00:00Z"}, "version": {"current": 1, "previous_version_id": null, "revision_reason": null}}
{"id": "12th_tamil_mp2_q1915", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "multiple_choice", "level": "hard", "difficulty": "hard", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "12", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "megapack_2", "lesson_id": "high_order_masterclass", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "statement_eval_sirupanattruppadai", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "சிறுபாணாற்றுப்படை பற்றிய கீழ்க்கண்ட கூற்றுகளை ஆராய்க:\n(1) இந்நூலின் பாட்டுடைத் தலைவன் ஓய்மானாட்டு நல்லியக்கோடன்.\n(2) இந்நூலை இயற்றியவர் இடைக்கழிநாட்டு நல்லூர் நத்தத்தனார்.\n(3) இந்நூலில் கடையேழு வள்ளல்களின் வரலாறும் கொடைச் சிறப்பும் கூறப்படவில்லை.\nஇவற்றுள் சரியான கூற்றுகள் எவை?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "(1) மற்றும் (3) மட்டுமே சரி", "B": "(2) மற்றும் (3) மட்டுமே சரி", "C": "(1) மற்றும் (2) மட்டுமே சரி", "D": "அனைத்தும் சரி"}, "explanation": "கூற்று (3) தவறானது; சிறுபாணாற்றுப்படையிலேயே பேகன், பாரி, காரி, ஆய், அதியன், நள்ளி, ஓரி ஆகிய கடையேழு வள்ளல்களின் பெயர்களும் விரிவாகக் கூறப்பட்டுள்ளன. எனவே (1) மற்றும் (2) மட்டுமே சரி."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "Examine the following statements regarding Sirupanattruppadai:\n(1) King Nalliyakkodan of Oymanadu is its celebrated patron hero.\n(2) It was composed by Nallur Nathathanar of Idaikkazhinadu.\n(3) It contains no reference to the seven great munificent patrons (Kadaiyezhu Vallalgal).\nWhich statements are correct?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "(1) and (3) only", "B": "(2) and (3) only", "C": "(1) and (2) only", "D": "All are correct"}, "explanation": "Statement (3) is false; Sirupanattruppadai is the principal primary text documenting the legends of the Kadaiyezhu Vallalgal. Statements (1) and (2) are correct."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "C", "accepted_keys": ["C"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "12", "term": "full_year", "edition": "2024-2025", "page": 165, "chapter": null, "section": null, "reference": "12th Tamil, Unit megapack_2, Page 165", "url": null, "source_notes": null}, "previous_year": {"is_previous_year": false, "exam": null, "exam_name": null, "year": null, "paper": null, "session": null}, "media": {"has_media": false, "items": []}, "tags": ["Class 12", "MegaPack 2", "Mock 6", "Sirupanattruppadai Statements"], "language_status": {"ta": "available", "en": "available"}, "workflow": {"status": "published", "verification_status": "verified", "created_by": "admin", "created_at": "2026-11-05T12:00:00Z", "updated_at": "2026-11-05T12:00:00Z"}, "version": {"current": 1, "previous_version_id": null, "revision_reason": null}}
{"id": "12th_tamil_mp2_q1916", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "multiple_choice", "level": "hard", "difficulty": "hard", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "12", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "megapack_2", "lesson_id": "high_order_masterclass", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "matching_puram_idols_rulers", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "பொருத்துக (சங்க நூல்கள் - பாட்டுடைத் தலைவர்கள்):\n(1) பொருநராற்றுப்படை - (i) தலையாலங்கானத்துச் செருவென்ற நெடுஞ்செழியன்\n(2) நெடுநல்வாடை - (ii) கரிகால் பெருவளத்தான்\n(3) முல்லைப்பாட்டு - (iii) இளந்திரையன்\n(4) பெரும்பாணாற்றுப்படை - (iv) நெடுஞ்செழியன்", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "(1)-(i), (2)-(ii), (3)-(iii), (4)-(iv)", "B": "(1)-(iii), (2)-(iv), (3)-(i), (4)-(ii)", "C": "(1)-(iv), (2)-(i), (3)-(ii), (4)-(iii)", "D": "(1)-(ii), (2)-(i), (3)-(iv), (4)-(iii)"}, "explanation": "பொருநராற்றுப்படை = கரிகாலன் (ii); நெடுநல்வாடை = பாண்டியன் நெடுஞ்செழியன் (i); முல்லைப்பாட்டு = பாண்டியன் நெடுஞ்செழியன் போர்க்களப் பாசறை (iv); பெரும்பாணாற்றுப்படை = தொண்டைமான் இளந்திரையன் (iii). சரியான வரிசை: D."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "Match the classical Pathuppaattu songs with their royal patrons:\n(1) Porunarattruppadai - (i) Thalaiyalanganathu Seruvendra Nedunchezhiyan\n(2) Nedunalvaadai - (ii) Karikala Peruvalathan\n(3) Mullaipaattu - (iii) Thondaiman Ilanthiraiyan\n(4) Perumpanattruppadai - (iv) Nedunchezhiyan in military camp", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "(1)-(i), (2)-(ii), (3)-(iii), (4)-(iv)", "B": "(1)-(iii), (2)-(iv), (3)-(i), (4)-(ii)", "C": "(1)-(iv), (2)-(i), (3)-(ii), (4)-(iii)", "D": "(1)-(ii), (2)-(i), (3)-(iv), (4)-(iii)"}, "explanation": "Matching: Porunarattruppadai-(ii), Nedunalvaadai-(i), Mullaipaattu-(iv), Perumpanattruppadai-(iii). Choice D is correct."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "D", "accepted_keys": ["D"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "12", "term": "full_year", "edition": "2024-2025", "page": 152, "chapter": null, "section": null, "reference": "12th Tamil, Unit megapack_2, Page 152", "url": null, "source_notes": null}, "previous_year": {"is_previous_year": false, "exam": null, "exam_name": null, "year": null, "paper": null, "session": null}, "media": {"has_media": false, "items": []}, "tags": ["Class 12", "MegaPack 2", "Mock 6", "Sangam Patrons Matching"], "language_status": {"ta": "available", "en": "available"}, "workflow": {"status": "published", "verification_status": "verified", "created_by": "admin", "created_at": "2026-11-05T12:00:00Z", "updated_at": "2026-11-05T12:00:00Z"}, "version": {"current": 1, "previous_version_id": null, "revision_reason": null}}
{"id": "12th_tamil_mp2_q1917", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "multiple_choice", "level": "hard", "difficulty": "hard", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "12", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "megapack_2", "lesson_id": "high_order_masterclass", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "assertion_reasoning_keeladi", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "கூற்று (A): கீழடி அகழாய்வு வைகைக்கரை நாகரிகம் ஒரு மிகச் சிறந்த நகர நாகரிகம் என்பதை வெளிப்படுத்தியுள்ளது.\nகாரணம் (R): செங்கல் கட்டுமானங்கள், சுடுமண் வடிகால் குழாய்கள், எழுத்தறிவு பெற்ற பானை ஓடுகள் ஆகியவை அங்கு பெருமளவில் கண்டெடுக்கப்பட்டுள்ளன.", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "கூற்று (A) மற்றும் காரணம் (R) இரண்டும் சரி; காரணம் கூற்றை மிகச் சரியாக விளக்குகிறது.", "B": "கூற்று (A) சரி, ஆனால் காரணம் (R) தவறு.", "C": "கூற்று (A) தவறு, ஆனால் காரணம் (R) சரி.", "D": "கூற்று (A) மற்றும் காரணம் (R) இரண்டும் தவறு."}, "explanation": "கீழடியில் கிடைத்துள்ள வடிகால் வசதியுடன் கூடிய செங்கல் கட்டிடங்களும், தமிழி எழுத்துப் பொறிப்புகளும் நகர நாகரிகத்தை நிறுவுகின்றன; கூற்றும் காரணமும் சரி."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "Assertion (A): Archaeological excavations at Keeladi firmly establish that the Vaigai river valley flourished as an advanced urban civilization.\nReason (R): Structural burnt-brick buildings, terracotta drainage pipes, and potsherds bearing Tamil-Brahmi scripts were unearthed in abundance.", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "Both Assertion (A) and Reason (R) are correct; Reason correctly explains Assertion.", "B": "Assertion (A) is correct, but Reason (R) is false.", "C": "Assertion (A) is false, but Reason (R) is correct.", "D": "Both Assertion (A) and Reason (R) are false."}, "explanation": "Both Assertion and Reason are scientifically validated by Keeladi archaeological excavations."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "A", "accepted_keys": ["A"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "12", "term": "full_year", "edition": "2024-2025", "page": 120, "chapter": null, "section": null, "reference": "12th Tamil, Unit megapack_2, Page 120", "url": null, "source_notes": null}, "previous_year": {"is_previous_year": false, "exam": null, "exam_name": null, "year": null, "paper": null, "session": null}, "media": {"has_media": false, "items": []}, "tags": ["Class 12", "MegaPack 2", "Mock 6", "Keeladi Assertion"], "language_status": {"ta": "available", "en": "available"}, "workflow": {"status": "published", "verification_status": "verified", "created_by": "admin", "created_at": "2026-11-05T12:00:00Z", "updated_at": "2026-11-05T12:00:00Z"}, "version": {"current": 1, "previous_version_id": null, "revision_reason": null}}
{"id": "12th_tamil_mp2_q1918", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "multiple_choice", "level": "hard", "difficulty": "hard", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "12", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "megapack_2", "lesson_id": "high_order_masterclass", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "matching_grammatical_concordance", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "பொருத்துக (திணை, பால் வழுவமைதிகள் - சான்றுகள்):\n(1) திணை வழுவமைதி - (i) என் அம்மை வந்தாள் (பசுவை நோக்கி)\n(2) பால் வழுவமைதி - (ii) வாடா செல்லம் (பெண் குழந்தையை நோக்கி)\n(3) இட வழுவமைதி - (iii) இந்த மாறன் ஒருநாளும் பொய் கூறமாட்டான்\n(4) கால வழுவமைதி - (iv) குடியரசுத் தலைவர் நாளை தமிழகம் வருகிறார்", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "(1)-(iv), (2)-(iii), (3)-(ii), (4)-(i)", "B": "(1)-(i), (2)-(ii), (3)-(iii), (4)-(iv)", "C": "(1)-(ii), (2)-(i), (3)-(iv), (4)-(iii)", "D": "(1)-(iii), (2)-(iv), (3)-(i), (4)-(ii)"}, "explanation": "அக்றிணையை உயர்திணையாகக் கூறுதல் திணை வழுவமைதி (i); பெண்பாலை ஆண்பாலாகக் கொஞ்சுதல் பால் வழுவமைதி (ii); தன்மை தன்னை படர்க்கையில் கூறுவது இட வழுவமைதி (iii); எதிர்காலத்தை நிகழ்காலத்தால் கூறுவது கால வழுவமைதி (iv)."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "Match the permissible grammatical deviations (Vazhuvamaidhi) with their canonical examples:\n(1) Thinai Vazhuvamaidhi - (i) 'My mother has come' (addressing a pet cow)\n(2) Paal Vazhuvamaidhi - (ii) 'Come here, my boy' (affectionately addressing a girl child)\n(3) Idam Vazhuvamaidhi - (iii) 'This Maran will never tell a lie' (first person speaking in third person)\n(4) Kaala Vazhuvamaidhi - (iv) 'The President arrives in Tamil Nadu tomorrow' (future indicated by present)", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "(1)-(iv), (2)-(iii), (3)-(ii), (4)-(i)", "B": "(1)-(i), (2)-(ii), (3)-(iii), (4)-(iv)", "C": "(1)-(ii), (2)-(i), (3)-(iv), (4)-(iii)", "D": "(1)-(iii), (2)-(iv), (3)-(i), (4)-(ii)"}, "explanation": "Matching: (1)-(i), (2)-(ii), (3)-(iii), (4)-(iv). Exact direct alignment is B."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "B", "accepted_keys": ["B"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "12", "term": "full_year", "edition": "2024-2025", "page": 17, "chapter": null, "section": null, "reference": "12th Tamil, Unit megapack_2, Page 17", "url": null, "source_notes": null}, "previous_year": {"is_previous_year": false, "exam": null, "exam_name": null, "year": null, "paper": null, "session": null}, "media": {"has_media": false, "items": []}, "tags": ["Class 12", "MegaPack 2", "Mock 6", "Grammar Concord Matching"], "language_status": {"ta": "available", "en": "available"}, "workflow": {"status": "published", "verification_status": "verified", "created_by": "admin", "created_at": "2026-11-05T12:00:00Z", "updated_at": "2026-11-05T12:00:00Z"}, "version": {"current": 1, "previous_version_id": null, "revision_reason": null}}
{"id": "12th_tamil_mp2_q1919", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "multiple_choice", "level": "hard", "difficulty": "hard", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "12", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "megapack_2", "lesson_id": "high_order_masterclass", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "statement_eval_thirukkural_governance", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "திருக்குறளின் செங்கோன்மை மற்றும் கொடுங்கோன்மை அதிகாரங்கள் பற்றிய கூற்றுகளை ஆராய்க:\n(1) 'முறைசெய்து காப்பாற்றும் மன்னவன் மக்கட்கு இறை என்று வைக்கப் படும்' என்பது வள்ளுவர் வாக்கு.\n(2) கொடுங்கோலனின் அடக்குமுறை ஆட்சியை வழிப்பறி கொள்ளையனின் மிரட்டலோடு ஒப்பிடுகிறார்.\n(3) செங்கோல் மன்னன் குடிமக்களின் கண்ணீரைப் படையாக மாற்றி அண்டை நாடுகளை வெல்வான்.\nஇவற்றுள் சரியான கூற்றுகள் எவை?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "(1) மற்றும் (3) மட்டுமே சரி", "B": "(2) மற்றும் (3) மட்டுமே சரி", "C": "(1) மற்றும் (2) மட்டுமே சரி", "D": "அனைத்தும் சரி"}, "explanation": "கூற்று (3) தவறானது; மக்களின் கண்ணீர் கொடுங்கோலனின் செல்வத்தைத் தேய்த்து அவனையே அழிக்கும் படையாக மாறும் என வள்ளுவர் எச்சரிக்கிறார். எனவே (1) மற்றும் (2) மட்டுமே சரி."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "Examine the statements regarding Thirukkural's chapters on Sceptred Justice and Tyranny:\n(1) A ruler who governs justly and protects citizens is revered as divine.\n(2) Tyrannical arbitrary taxation is equated to extortion at lance-point by highway bandits.\n(3) A just king uses his citizens' tears as an offensive army to conquer neighbors.\nWhich statements are correct?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "(1) and (3) only", "B": "(2) and (3) only", "C": "(1) and (2) only", "D": "All are correct"}, "explanation": "Statement (3) is false; citizens' tears act as a destructive force that erodes the tyrant's kingdom, not an offensive tool. (1) and (2) are correct."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "C", "accepted_keys": ["C"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "12", "term": "full_year", "edition": "2024-2025", "page": 175, "chapter": null, "section": null, "reference": "12th Tamil, Unit megapack_2, Page 175", "url": null, "source_notes": null}, "previous_year": {"is_previous_year": false, "exam": null, "exam_name": null, "year": null, "paper": null, "session": null}, "media": {"has_media": false, "items": []}, "tags": ["Class 12", "MegaPack 2", "Mock 6", "Governance Statements"], "language_status": {"ta": "available", "en": "available"}, "workflow": {"status": "published", "verification_status": "verified", "created_by": "admin", "created_at": "2026-11-05T12:00:00Z", "updated_at": "2026-11-05T12:00:00Z"}, "version": {"current": 1, "previous_version_id": null, "revision_reason": null}}
{"id": "12th_tamil_mp2_q1920", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "multiple_choice", "level": "hard", "difficulty": "hard", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "12", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "megapack_2", "lesson_id": "high_order_masterclass", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "matching_contemporary_genres", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "பொருத்துக (நவீனப் படைப்புகள் - ஆசிரியர்கள்):\n(1) தலைக்குளம் - (i) சுகந்தி சுப்பிரமணியன்\n(2) முகம் - (ii) தோப்பில் முகமது மீரான்\n(3) கோடை மழை - (iii) பூமணி\n(4) உரிமைத்தாகம் - (iv) சாந்தா தத்", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "(1)-(i), (2)-(ii), (3)-(iii), (4)-(iv)", "B": "(1)-(iii), (2)-(iv), (3)-(i), (4)-(ii)", "C": "(1)-(iv), (2)-(iii), (3)-(ii), (4)-(i)", "D": "(1)-(ii), (2)-(i), (3)-(iv), (4)-(iii)"}, "explanation": "தலைக்குளம் = தோப்பில் முகமது மீரான் (ii); முகம் = சுகந்தி சுப்பிரமணியன் (i); கோடை மழை = சாந்தா தத் (iv); உரிமைத்தாகம் = பூமணி (iii). சரியான வரிசை: D."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "Match modern literary prose and poetry works with their respective authors:\n(1) Thalaikkulam - (i) Sukanthi Subramaniyan\n(2) Mugam - (ii) Thoppil Mohamed Meeran\n(3) Kodai Mazhai - (iii) Poomani\n(4) Urimaithaagam - (iv) Shantha Dutt", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "(1)-(i), (2)-(ii), (3)-(iii), (4)-(iv)", "B": "(1)-(iii), (2)-(iv), (3)-(i), (4)-(ii)", "C": "(1)-(iv), (2)-(iii), (3)-(ii), (4)-(i)", "D": "(1)-(ii), (2)-(i), (3)-(iv), (4)-(iii)"}, "explanation": "Matching: Thalaikkulam-(ii), Mugam-(i), Kodai Mazhai-(iv), Urimaithaagam-(iii). Choice D is correct."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "D", "accepted_keys": ["D"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "12", "term": "full_year", "edition": "2024-2025", "page": 170, "chapter": null, "section": null, "reference": "12th Tamil, Unit megapack_2, Page 170", "url": null, "source_notes": null}, "previous_year": {"is_previous_year": false, "exam": null, "exam_name": null, "year": null, "paper": null, "session": null}, "media": {"has_media": false, "items": []}, "tags": ["Class 12", "MegaPack 2", "Mock 6", "Modern Literature Matching"], "language_status": {"ta": "available", "en": "available"}, "workflow": {"status": "published", "verification_status": "verified", "created_by": "admin", "created_at": "2026-11-05T12:00:00Z", "updated_at": "2026-11-05T12:00:00Z"}, "version": {"current": 1, "previous_version_id": null, "revision_reason": null}}
{"id": "12th_tamil_mp2_q1921", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "multiple_choice", "level": "hard", "difficulty": "hard", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "12", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "megapack_2", "lesson_id": "high_order_masterclass", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "assertion_reasoning_tholkappiyam_meyppadu", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "கூற்று (A): தொல்காப்பியரின் மெய்ப்பாட்டியல் வடமொழிக் காவிய இயலின் 'ரச'க் கோட்பாட்டுக்கு முற்பட்ட தனித்தமிழ்க் கோட்பாடாகும்.\nகாரணம் (R): தொல்காப்பியர் நாடக அரங்கிற்கு மட்டுமின்றி, அகம்-புறம் ஆகிய செய்யுள்களின் உணர்ச்சி வெளிப்பாட்டிற்கும் மெய்ப்பாட்டை அடிப்படையாகக் கொண்டு இலக்கணம் வகுத்துள்ளார்.", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "கூற்று (A) மற்றும் காரணம் (R) இரண்டும் சரி; காரணம் கூற்றை மிகச் சரியாக விளக்குகிறது.", "B": "கூற்று (A) சரி, ஆனால் காரணம் (R) தவறு.", "C": "கூற்று (A) தவறு, ஆனால் காரணம் (R) சரி.", "D": "கூற்று (A) மற்றும் காரணம் (R) இரண்டும் தவறு."}, "explanation": "தொல்காப்பிய மெய்ப்பாட்டியல் செய்யுளுக்குரிய அக உணர்வுகளையும் நாடகப் பாங்கையும் உடம்பின் மெய்ப்பாடுகளாகக் கட்டமைத்த தனித்தமிழ் அழகியல் கோட்பாடாகும்; கூற்றும் காரணமும் முற்றிலும் சரி."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "Assertion (A): Tholkappiyar's Meyppattiyal constitutes an indigenous ancient Tamil aesthetic emotional theory predating later Sanskrit Rasa theories.\nReason (R): Tholkappiyar formulated Meyppadu not merely for dramatic stages but as the psychosomatic emotional foundation for Aham and Puram poetry.", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "Both Assertion (A) and Reason (R) are correct; Reason correctly explains Assertion.", "B": "Assertion (A) is correct, but Reason (R) is false.", "C": "Assertion (A) is false, but Reason (R) is correct.", "D": "Both Assertion (A) and Reason (R) are false."}, "explanation": "Both Assertion and Reason are authentic, celebrating the antiquity and depth of Tamil poetic psychology."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "A", "accepted_keys": ["A"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "12", "term": "full_year", "edition": "2024-2025", "page": 137, "chapter": null, "section": null, "reference": "12th Tamil, Unit megapack_2, Page 137", "url": null, "source_notes": null}, "previous_year": {"is_previous_year": false, "exam": null, "exam_name": null, "year": null, "paper": null, "session": null}, "media": {"has_media": false, "items": []}, "tags": ["Class 12", "MegaPack 2", "Mock 6", "Meyppattiyal Assertion"], "language_status": {"ta": "available", "en": "available"}, "workflow": {"status": "published", "verification_status": "verified", "created_by": "admin", "created_at": "2026-11-05T12:00:00Z", "updated_at": "2026-11-05T12:00:00Z"}, "version": {"current": 1, "previous_version_id": null, "revision_reason": null}}
{"id": "12th_tamil_mp2_q1922", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "multiple_choice", "level": "hard", "difficulty": "hard", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "12", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "megapack_2", "lesson_id": "high_order_masterclass", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "matching_thinai_landscapes", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "பொருத்துக (ஐந்திணைகள் - நிலங்கள்):\n(1) குறிஞ்சி - (i) கடலும் கடல் சார்ந்த நிலமும்\n(2) முல்லை - (ii) காடும் காடு சார்ந்த நிலமும்\n(3) மருதம் - (iii) மலையும் மலை சார்ந்த நிலமும்\n(4) நெய்தல் - (iv) வயலும் வயல் சார்ந்த நிலமும்", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "(1)-(i), (2)-(ii), (3)-(iii), (4)-(iv)", "B": "(1)-(iii), (2)-(ii), (3)-(iv), (4)-(i)", "C": "(1)-(ii), (2)-(iii), (3)-(i), (4)-(iv)", "D": "(1)-(iv), (2)-(i), (3)-(ii), (4)-(iii)"}, "explanation": "குறிஞ்சி = மலை (iii); முல்லை = காடு (ii); மருதம் = வயல் (iv); நெய்தல் = கடல் (i). சரியான வரிசை: B."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "Match the five classical Sangam landscapes (Ainthinai) with their eco-zones:\n(1) Kurinji - (i) Coastal marine tract\n(2) Mullai - (ii) Forest / Woodland pasture\n(3) Marudham - (iii) Mountainous hilly terrain\n(4) Neithal - (iv) Agricultural fertile plains", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "(1)-(i), (2)-(ii), (3)-(iii), (4)-(iv)", "B": "(1)-(iii), (2)-(ii), (3)-(iv), (4)-(i)", "C": "(1)-(ii), (2)-(iii), (3)-(i), (4)-(iv)", "D": "(1)-(iv), (2)-(i), (3)-(ii), (4)-(iii)"}, "explanation": "Matching: Kurinji-(iii), Mullai-(ii), Marudham-(iv), Neithal-(i). Choice B is correct."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "B", "accepted_keys": ["B"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "12", "term": "full_year", "edition": "2024-2025", "page": 112, "chapter": null, "section": null, "reference": "12th Tamil, Unit megapack_2, Page 112", "url": null, "source_notes": null}, "previous_year": {"is_previous_year": false, "exam": null, "exam_name": null, "year": null, "paper": null, "session": null}, "media": {"has_media": false, "items": []}, "tags": ["Class 12", "MegaPack 2", "Mock 6", "Thinai Matching"], "language_status": {"ta": "available", "en": "available"}, "workflow": {"status": "published", "verification_status": "verified", "created_by": "admin", "created_at": "2026-11-05T12:00:00Z", "updated_at": "2026-11-05T12:00:00Z"}, "version": {"current": 1, "previous_version_id": null, "revision_reason": null}}
{"id": "12th_tamil_mp2_q1923", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "multiple_choice", "level": "hard", "difficulty": "hard", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "12", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "megapack_2", "lesson_id": "high_order_masterclass", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "statement_eval_sculptures_history", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "தமிழ்நாட்டுச் சிற்பக்கலை வரலாறு பற்றிய கீழ்க்கண்ட கூற்றுகளை ஆராய்க:\n(1) பல்லவர் காலத்தில் சுதை, மரம் ஆகியவற்றிலிருந்து பாறைகளைக் குடையும் குடைவரைக் கலை வளர்ந்தது.\n(2) சோழர் காலம் வெண்கலச் சிற்பங்களின் பொற்காலம் என்று அழைக்கப்படுகிறது.\n(3) நாயக்கர் காலத்தில் சிற்பங்கள் முற்றிலும் தடைசெய்யப்பட்டு ஓவியங்கள் மட்டுமே வரையப்பட்டன.\nஇவற்றுள் சரியான கூற்றுகள் எவை?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "(1) மற்றும் (3) மட்டுமே சரி", "B": "(2) மற்றும் (3) மட்டுமே சரி", "C": "(1) மற்றும் (2) மட்டுமே சரி", "D": "அனைத்தும் சரி"}, "explanation": "கூற்று (3) தவறானது; நாயக்கர் காலத்தில் ஆயிரங்கால் மண்டபங்களும் நுணுக்கமான யாளித் தூண் சிற்பங்களும் கம்பீரமாக வளர்ந்தன. எனவே (1) மற்றும் (2) மட்டுமே சரி."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "Examine the statements regarding Tamil sculptural history:\n(1) Pallavas transitioned from stucco/wood to excavating living monolithic rock-cut cave temples.\n(2) The Chola era is globally acclaimed as the Golden Age of bronze casting.\n(3) Nayak rulers banned stone sculpture entirely and patronized only painting.\nWhich statements are correct?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "(1) and (3) only", "B": "(2) and (3) only", "C": "(1) and (2) only", "D": "All are correct"}, "explanation": "Statement (3) is false; Nayaks produced towering sculptural thousand-pillared halls and monolithic Yalis. (1) and (2) are correct."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "C", "accepted_keys": ["C"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "12", "term": "full_year", "edition": "2024-2025", "page": 124, "chapter": null, "section": null, "reference": "12th Tamil, Unit megapack_2, Page 124", "url": null, "source_notes": null}, "previous_year": {"is_previous_year": false, "exam": null, "exam_name": null, "year": null, "paper": null, "session": null}, "media": {"has_media": false, "items": []}, "tags": ["Class 12", "MegaPack 2", "Mock 6", "Sculptural History Statements"], "language_status": {"ta": "available", "en": "available"}, "workflow": {"status": "published", "verification_status": "verified", "created_by": "admin", "created_at": "2026-11-05T12:00:00Z", "updated_at": "2026-11-05T12:00:00Z"}, "version": {"current": 1, "previous_version_id": null, "revision_reason": null}}
{"id": "12th_tamil_mp2_q1924", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "multiple_choice", "level": "hard", "difficulty": "hard", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "12", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "megapack_2", "lesson_id": "high_order_masterclass", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "matching_poets_journals", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "பொருத்துக (இதழ்கள் - ஆசிரியர்கள் / தொடர்புடைய ஆளுமைகள்):\n(1) எழுத்து - (i) பாரதியார்\n(2) இந்தியா - (ii) சி.சு. செல்லப்பா\n(3) காவியம் - (iii) உத்தமசோழன்\n(4) கிழக்கு வாசல் உதயம் - (iv) சுரதா", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "(1)-(i), (2)-(ii), (3)-(iii), (4)-(iv)", "B": "(1)-(iii), (2)-(i), (3)-(iv), (4)-(ii)", "C": "(1)-(iv), (2)-(iii), (3)-(ii), (4)-(i)", "D": "(1)-(ii), (2)-(i), (3)-(iv), (4)-(iii)"}, "explanation": "எழுத்து = சி.சு. செல்லப்பா (ii); இந்தியா = பாரதியார் (i); காவியம் = சுரதா (iv); கிழக்கு வாசல் உதயம் = உத்தமசோழன் (iii). சரியான வரிசை: D."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "Match the Tamil periodicals and magazines with their respective editors:\n(1) Ezhuthu - (i) Subramania Bharati\n(2) India - (ii) C.S. Chellappa\n(3) Kaaviyam - (iii) Uthamacholan\n(4) Kizhakku Vaasal Udhayam - (iv) Suradha", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "(1)-(i), (2)-(ii), (3)-(iii), (4)-(iv)", "B": "(1)-(iii), (2)-(i), (3)-(iv), (4)-(ii)", "C": "(1)-(iv), (2)-(iii), (3)-(ii), (4)-(i)", "D": "(1)-(ii), (2)-(i), (3)-(iv), (4)-(iii)"}, "explanation": "Matching: Ezhuthu-(ii), India-(i), Kaaviyam-(iv), Kizhakku Vaasal Udhayam-(iii). Choice D is correct."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "D", "accepted_keys": ["D"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "12", "term": "full_year", "edition": "2024-2025", "page": 148, "chapter": null, "section": null, "reference": "12th Tamil, Unit megapack_2, Page 148", "url": null, "source_notes": null}, "previous_year": {"is_previous_year": false, "exam": null, "exam_name": null, "year": null, "paper": null, "session": null}, "media": {"has_media": false, "items": []}, "tags": ["Class 12", "MegaPack 2", "Mock 6", "Journal Matching"], "language_status": {"ta": "available", "en": "available"}, "workflow": {"status": "published", "verification_status": "verified", "created_by": "admin", "created_at": "2026-11-05T12:00:00Z", "updated_at": "2026-11-05T12:00:00Z"}, "version": {"current": 1, "previous_version_id": null, "revision_reason": null}}
{"id": "12th_tamil_mp2_q1925", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "multiple_choice", "level": "hard", "difficulty": "hard", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "12", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "megapack_2", "lesson_id": "high_order_masterclass", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "assertion_reasoning_padimam_modern_verse", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "கூற்று (A): புதுக்கவிதையில் படிமம் என்பது வெறும் சொல்லலங்காரம் அல்லாமல் ஒரு கருத்தின் உணர்ச்சிப் பெருக்கை வெளிப்படுத்தும் முதன்மைக் கருவியாகும்.\nகாரணம் (R): வாசகரின் மனக்கண் முன் காட்சிகளை உருவாக்குவதன் மூலம் படிமம் சொல்லப்படாத ஆழ்ந்த பொருளையும் நொடிப்பொழுதில் கடத்துகிறது.", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "கூற்று (A) மற்றும் காரணம் (R) இரண்டும் சரி; காரணம் கூற்றை மிகச் சரியாக விளக்குகிறது.", "B": "கூற்று (A) சரி, ஆனால் காரணம் (R) தவறு.", "C": "கூற்று (A) தவறு, ஆனால் காரணம் (R) சரி.", "D": "கூற்று (A) மற்றும் காரணம் (R) இரண்டும் தவறு."}, "explanation": "படிமம் என்பது வாசகனின் மனத்தில் காட்சியை உருவாக்கி உணர்ச்சியைத் தூண்டும் வலிமைமிக்க அழகியல் உத்தியாகும்; கூற்றும் காரணமும் முற்றிலும் சரி."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "Assertion (A): In modern free verse, imagery (Padimam) is not mere ornamentation, but an essential emotional vehicle of philosophical thought.\nReason (R): By sculpting mental visuals before the reader's eye, imagery transmits unsaid multi-layered emotional nuances instantaneously.", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "Both Assertion (A) and Reason (R) are correct; Reason correctly explains Assertion.", "B": "Assertion (A) is correct, but Reason (R) is false.", "C": "Assertion (A) is false, but Reason (R) is correct.", "D": "Both Assertion (A) and Reason (R) are false."}, "explanation": "Both Assertion and Reason are aesthetic truths illuminating the functional significance of modern poetic imagery."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "A", "accepted_keys": ["A"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "12", "term": "full_year", "edition": "2024-2025", "page": 114, "chapter": null, "section": null, "reference": "12th Tamil, Unit megapack_2, Page 114", "url": null, "source_notes": null}, "previous_year": {"is_previous_year": false, "exam": null, "exam_name": null, "year": null, "paper": null, "session": null}, "media": {"has_media": false, "items": []}, "tags": ["Class 12", "MegaPack 2", "Mock 6", "Padimam Assertion"], "language_status": {"ta": "available", "en": "available"}, "workflow": {"status": "published", "verification_status": "verified", "created_by": "admin", "created_at": "2026-11-05T12:00:00Z", "updated_at": "2026-11-05T12:00:00Z"}, "version": {"current": 1, "previous_version_id": null, "revision_reason": null}}
{"id": "12th_tamil_mp2_q1926", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "multiple_choice", "level": "hard", "difficulty": "hard", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "12", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "megapack_2", "lesson_id": "high_order_masterclass", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "matching_sangam_kings_hills", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "பொருத்துக (கடையேழு வள்ளல்கள் - மலைகள் / நாடுகள்):\n(1) பாரி - (i) பொதினி (பழனி மலை)\n(2) பேகன் - (ii) பறம்பு மலை\n(3) ஓரி - (iii) கண்டீர நாடு (தோட்டி மலை)\n(4) நள்ளி - (iv) கொல்லி மலை", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "(1)-(i), (2)-(ii), (3)-(iii), (4)-(iv)", "B": "(1)-(ii), (2)-(i), (3)-(iv), (4)-(iii)", "C": "(1)-(iii), (2)-(iv), (3)-(i), (4)-(ii)", "D": "(1)-(iv), (2)-(iii), (3)-(ii), (4)-(i)"}, "explanation": "பாரி = பறம்பு மலை (ii); பேகன் = பழனி மலை (i); ஓரி = கொல்லி மலை (iv); நள்ளி = தோட்டி மலை (iii). சரியான வரிசை: B."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "Match the Kadaiyezhu Vallalgal with their ruled hills/regions:\n(1) Paari - (i) Pothini (Palani Hills)\n(2) Pegan - (ii) Parambu Hills\n(3) Ori - (iii) Kandeera Nadu (Thotti Hills)\n(4) Nalli - (iv) Kolli Hills", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "(1)-(i), (2)-(ii), (3)-(iii), (4)-(iv)", "B": "(1)-(ii), (2)-(i), (3)-(iv), (4)-(iii)", "C": "(1)-(iii), (2)-(iv), (3)-(i), (4)-(ii)", "D": "(1)-(iv), (2)-(iii), (3)-(ii), (4)-(i)"}, "explanation": "Matching: Paari-(ii), Pegan-(i), Ori-(iv), Nalli-(iii). Choice B is correct."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "B", "accepted_keys": ["B"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "12", "term": "full_year", "edition": "2024-2025", "page": 166, "chapter": null, "section": null, "reference": "12th Tamil, Unit megapack_2, Page 166", "url": null, "source_notes": null}, "previous_year": {"is_previous_year": false, "exam": null, "exam_name": null, "year": null, "paper": null, "session": null}, "media": {"has_media": false, "items": []}, "tags": ["Class 12", "MegaPack 2", "Mock 6", "Vallalgal Hills Matching"], "language_status": {"ta": "available", "en": "available"}, "workflow": {"status": "published", "verification_status": "verified", "created_by": "admin", "created_at": "2026-11-05T12:00:00Z", "updated_at": "2026-11-05T12:00:00Z"}, "version": {"current": 1, "previous_version_id": null, "revision_reason": null}}
{"id": "12th_tamil_mp2_q1927", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "multiple_choice", "level": "hard", "difficulty": "hard", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "12", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "megapack_2", "lesson_id": "high_order_masterclass", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "statement_eval_epics_comparison", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "சிலப்பதிகாரம் மற்றும் கம்பராமாயணம் பற்றிய கீழ்க்கண்ட ஒப்பீட்டுக் கூற்றுகளை ஆராய்க:\n(1) சிலப்பதிகாரம் 3 காண்டங்களையும், கம்பராமாயணம் 6 காண்டங்களையும் கொண்டுள்ளன.\n(2) சிலப்பதிகாரத்தின் ஆசிரியர் சமண சமயத்து இளங்கோவடிகள்; கம்பர் வைணவ மரபில் தோன்றியவர்.\n(3) இரண்டு காப்பியங்களும் வடமொழி வால்மீகி இராமாயணத்தின் நேரடி மொழிபெயர்ப்புகளாகும்.\nஇவற்றுள் சரியான கூற்றுகள் எவை?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "(1) மற்றும் (3) மட்டுமே சரி", "B": "(2) மற்றும் (3) மட்டுமே சரி", "C": "(1) மற்றும் (2) மட்டுமே சரி", "D": "அனைத்தும் சரி"}, "explanation": "கூற்று (3) முற்றிலும் தவறானது; சிலப்பதிகாரம் முழுக்க முழுக்கத் தமிழரின் தனிப்பெரும் சுயசார்புக் காப்பியம்; கம்பராமாயணமும் வழிநூலேயன்றி நேரடி மொழிபெயர்ப்பு அல்ல. எனவே (1) மற்றும் (2) மட்டுமே சரி."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "Examine the comparative statements regarding Silappathikaram and Kamba Ramayanam:\n(1) Silappathikaram has 3 Kandams; Kamba Ramayanam comprises 6 Kandams.\n(2) Ilango Adigal belonged to the Jain ascetic tradition; Kambar belonged to Tamil Vaishnava tradition.\n(3) Both epics are verbatim literal translations of Valmiki's Sanskrit Ramayana.\nWhich statements are correct?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "(1) and (3) only", "B": "(2) and (3) only", "C": "(1) and (2) only", "D": "All are correct"}, "explanation": "Statement (3) is false; Silappathikaram is a native Tamil epic, and Kamba Ramayanam is a creative transcreation, not a literal translation. (1) and (2) are correct."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "C", "accepted_keys": ["C"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "12", "term": "full_year", "edition": "2024-2025", "page": 128, "chapter": null, "section": null, "reference": "12th Tamil, Unit megapack_2, Page 128", "url": null, "source_notes": null}, "previous_year": {"is_previous_year": false, "exam": null, "exam_name": null, "year": null, "paper": null, "session": null}, "media": {"has_media": false, "items": []}, "tags": ["Class 12", "MegaPack 2", "Mock 6", "Epic Comparison Statements"], "language_status": {"ta": "available", "en": "available"}, "workflow": {"status": "published", "verification_status": "verified", "created_by": "admin", "created_at": "2026-11-05T12:00:00Z", "updated_at": "2026-11-05T12:00:00Z"}, "version": {"current": 1, "previous_version_id": null, "revision_reason": null}}
{"id": "12th_tamil_mp2_q1928", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "multiple_choice", "level": "hard", "difficulty": "hard", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "12", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "megapack_2", "lesson_id": "high_order_masterclass", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "chronology_great_poets", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "கீழ்க்கண்ட தமிழ்ப் புலவர்களையும் அறிஞர்களையும் கால வரிசைப்படி ஒழுங்குபடுத்துக:\n(1) தொல்காப்பியர்\n(2) இளங்கோவடிகள்\n(3) கம்பர்\n(4) மகாகவி பாரதியார்", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "(2) - (1) - (3) - (4)", "B": "(3) - (1) - (2) - (4)", "C": "(4) - (3) - (2) - (1)", "D": "(1) - (2) - (3) - (4)"}, "explanation": "சரியான காலவரிசை: தொல்காப்பியர் (சங்க காலத்திற்கு முற்பட்டவர்/சங்க காலம்) -> இளங்கோவடிகள் (கி.பி. 2-ஆம் நூற்றாண்டு) -> கம்பர் (கி.பி. 12-ஆம் நூற்றாண்டு) -> பாரதியார் (கி.பி. 20-ஆம் நூற்றாண்டு)."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "Arrange the following great Tamil literary masters in strict chronological sequence:\n(1) Tholkappiyar\n(2) Ilango Adigal\n(3) Kambar\n(4) Mahakavi Subramania Bharati", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "(2) - (1) - (3) - (4)", "B": "(3) - (1) - (2) - (4)", "C": "(4) - (3) - (2) - (1)", "D": "(1) Tholkappiyar -> (2) Ilango Adigal -> (3) Kambar -> (4) Bharati"}, "explanation": "Correct historical sequence: Tholkappiyar (ancient), Ilango Adigal (c. 2nd c. CE), Kambar (12th c. CE), Bharati (20th c. CE)."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "D", "accepted_keys": ["D"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "12", "term": "full_year", "edition": "2024-2025", "page": 155, "chapter": null, "section": null, "reference": "12th Tamil, Unit megapack_2, Page 155", "url": null, "source_notes": null}, "previous_year": {"is_previous_year": false, "exam": null, "exam_name": null, "year": null, "paper": null, "session": null}, "media": {"has_media": false, "items": []}, "tags": ["Class 12", "MegaPack 2", "Mock 6", "Chronology Masters"], "language_status": {"ta": "available", "en": "available"}, "workflow": {"status": "published", "verification_status": "verified", "created_by": "admin", "created_at": "2026-11-05T12:00:00Z", "updated_at": "2026-11-05T12:00:00Z"}, "version": {"current": 1, "previous_version_id": null, "revision_reason": null}}
{"id": "12th_tamil_mp2_q1929", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "multiple_choice", "level": "hard", "difficulty": "hard", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "12", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "megapack_2", "lesson_id": "high_order_masterclass", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "assertion_reasoning_thirukkural_secular", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "கூற்று (A): திருக்குறள் எந்த ஒரு குறிப்பிட்ட மதத்திற்கோ, சாதிக்கோ, நாட்டிற்கோ உரிய நூல் அல்லாமல் 'உலகப் பொதுமறை'யாகப் போற்றப்படுகிறது.\nகாரணம் (R): வள்ளுவர் கடவுள் வாழ்த்திலும் பிற அதிகாரங்களிலும் எந்த ஒரு குறிப்பிட்ட சமயக் கடவுளின் பெயரையும் சுட்டாமல் மனித சமுதாயத்தின் பொதுவான அற விழுமியங்களைப் பாடியுள்ளார்.", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "கூற்று (A) மற்றும் காரணம் (R) இரண்டும் சரி; காரணம் கூற்றை மிகச் சரியாக விளக்குகிறது.", "B": "கூற்று (A) சரி, ஆனால் காரணம் (R) தவறு.", "C": "கூற்று (A) தவறு, ஆனால் காரணம் (R) சரி.", "D": "கூற்று (A) மற்றும் காரணம் (R) இரண்டும் தவறு."}, "explanation": "வள்ளுவர் எம்மதக் கடவுளின் பெயரையும் குறிப்பிடாமல் 'வாலறிவன்', 'எண்குணத்தான்' போன்ற பொதுப்பெயர்களாலேயே அறத்தைப் பாடியதால் இது உலகப் பொதுமறையானது; கூற்றும் காரணமும் சரி."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "Assertion (A): Thirukkural transcends specific sectarian religious cults, castes, and geography, celebrated as the 'Universal Scripture' (Ulagap Pothumarai).\nReason (R): Valluvar invokes no sectarian sectarian theistic deities, instead addressing universal humanist human ethical truths applicable across all ages.", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "Both Assertion (A) and Reason (R) are correct; Reason correctly explains Assertion.", "B": "Assertion (A) is correct, but Reason (R) is false.", "C": "Assertion (A) is false, but Reason (R) is correct.", "D": "Both Assertion (A) and Reason (R) are false."}, "explanation": "Both Assertion and Reason are impeccably correct, underlining the secular, universal humanism of Thirukkural."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "A", "accepted_keys": ["A"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "12", "term": "full_year", "edition": "2024-2025", "page": 174, "chapter": null, "section": null, "reference": "12th Tamil, Unit megapack_2, Page 174", "url": null, "source_notes": null}, "previous_year": {"is_previous_year": false, "exam": null, "exam_name": null, "year": null, "paper": null, "session": null}, "media": {"has_media": false, "items": []}, "tags": ["Class 12", "MegaPack 2", "Mock 6", "Thirukkural Assertion"], "language_status": {"ta": "available", "en": "available"}, "workflow": {"status": "published", "verification_status": "verified", "created_by": "admin", "created_at": "2026-11-05T12:00:00Z", "updated_at": "2026-11-05T12:00:00Z"}, "version": {"current": 1, "previous_version_id": null, "revision_reason": null}}
{"id": "12th_tamil_mp2_q1930", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "multiple_choice", "level": "hard", "difficulty": "hard", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "12", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "megapack_2", "lesson_id": "high_order_masterclass", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "matching_grammatical_terms_nannool", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "பொருத்துக (புணர்ச்சி விதிகள் - சான்றுகள்):\n(1) இ ஈ ஐ வழி யவ்வும் - (i) மணி + அடித்தது = மணியடித்தது\n(2) ஏனை உயிர் வழி வவ்வும் - (ii) பல + பல = பலப்பல\n(3) உடல்மேல் உயிர்வந்து ஒன்றுவது - (iii) பால் + ஆடை = பாலாடை\n(4) இயல்பினும் விதியினும் நின்ற உயிர்முன் க ச த ப மிகும் - (iv) பூ + சோலை = பூச்சோலை", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "(1)-(ii), (2)-(i), (3)-(iv), (4)-(iii)", "B": "(1)-(i), (2)-(ii), (3)-(iii), (4)-(iv)", "C": "(1)-(iii), (2)-(iv), (3)-(i), (4)-(ii)", "D": "(1)-(iv), (2)-(iii), (3)-(ii), (4)-(i)"}, "explanation": "மணி + அடித்தது = மணியடித்தது (யகர உடம்படுமெய்); பல + பல = பலப்பல (வல்லினம் மிகுதல்); பால் + ஆடை = பாலாடை (உடல்மேல் உயிர்); பூ + சோலை = பூச்சோலை (உயிர்முன் கசதப). சரியான வரிசை: B."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "Match the Nannool sandhi euphonic rules with their accurate textual examples:\n(1) 'I, Ee, Ai vazhi yavvum' - (i) Mani + aditthadhu = Maniyaditthadhu\n(2) 'Eenai uyir vazhi vavvum' - (ii) Pala + pala = Palappala\n(3) 'Udalmel uyir vandhu ondruvadhuiyalbe' - (iii) Paal + aadai = Paalaadai\n(4) 'Iyalbinum vidhiyinumninra uyirmun kasathapa migum' - (iv) Poo + solai = Poocholai", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "(1)-(ii), (2)-(i), (3)-(iv), (4)-(iii)", "B": "(1)-(i), (2)-(ii), (3)-(iii), (4)-(iv)", "C": "(1)-(iii), (2)-(iv), (3)-(i), (4)-(ii)", "D": "(1)-(iv), (2)-(iii), (3)-(ii), (4)-(i)"}, "explanation": "Matching aligns directly: (1)-(i), (2)-(ii), (3)-(iii), (4)-(iv). Sequence B is correct."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "B", "accepted_keys": ["B"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "12", "term": "full_year", "edition": "2024-2025", "page": 42, "chapter": null, "section": null, "reference": "12th Tamil, Unit megapack_2, Page 42", "url": null, "source_notes": null}, "previous_year": {"is_previous_year": false, "exam": null, "exam_name": null, "year": null, "paper": null, "session": null}, "media": {"has_media": false, "items": []}, "tags": ["Class 12", "MegaPack 2", "Mock 6", "Sandhi Rules Matching"], "language_status": {"ta": "available", "en": "available"}, "workflow": {"status": "published", "verification_status": "verified", "created_by": "admin", "created_at": "2026-11-05T12:00:00Z", "updated_at": "2026-11-05T12:00:00Z"}, "version": {"current": 1, "previous_version_id": null, "revision_reason": null}}
{"id": "12th_tamil_mp2_q1931", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "multiple_choice", "level": "hard", "difficulty": "hard", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "12", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "megapack_2", "lesson_id": "high_order_masterclass", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "statement_eval_tamil_print_history", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "தமிழ் அச்சுப் பதிப்பு வரலாறு பற்றிய கீழ்க்கண்ட கூற்றுகளை ஆராய்க:\n(1) தமிழில் அச்சிடப்பட்ட முதல் நூல் கார்ட்டிலா (Cartilha - 1554 Lisbon).\n(2) சீகன்பால்கு தரங்கம்பாடியில் முதன்முதலில் தமிழ்ச் சொந்த அச்சுக்கூடத்தை நிறுவினார் (1712).\n(3) உ.வே.சா அவர்கள் முதன்முதலில் அச்சேற்றிய செவ்விலக்கிய நூல் கம்பராமாயணம் ஆகும்.\nஇவற்றுள் சரியான கூற்றுகள் எவை?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "(1) மற்றும் (3) மட்டுமே சரி", "B": "(2) மற்றும் (3) மட்டுமே சரி", "C": "(1) மற்றும் (2) மட்டுமே சரி", "D": "அனைத்தும் சரி"}, "explanation": "கூற்று (3) தவறானது; உ.வே.சா முதன்முதலில் 1887-இல் பதிப்பித்து வெளியிட்ட செவ்விலக்கிய நூல் 'சீவக சிந்தாமணி' ஆகும். எனவே (1) மற்றும் (2) மட்டுமே சரி."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "Examine the statements regarding Tamil print history:\n(1) The earliest printed book containing Tamil was 'Cartilha' published at Lisbon in 1754.\n(2) Ziegenbalg set up the pioneering Tamil press at Tharangambadi in 1712.\n(3) The very first classical literary text printed by U.Ve.Sa was Kamba Ramayanam.\nWhich statements are correct?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "(1) and (3) only", "B": "(2) and (3) only", "C": "(1) and (2) only", "D": "All are correct"}, "explanation": "Statement (3) is false; U.Ve.Sa's maiden classical publication was Seevaka Chinthamani in 1887. Statements (1) and (2) are correct."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "C", "accepted_keys": ["C"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "12", "term": "full_year", "edition": "2024-2025", "page": 72, "chapter": null, "section": null, "reference": "12th Tamil, Unit megapack_2, Page 72", "url": null, "source_notes": null}, "previous_year": {"is_previous_year": false, "exam": null, "exam_name": null, "year": null, "paper": null, "session": null}, "media": {"has_media": false, "items": []}, "tags": ["Class 12", "MegaPack 2", "Mock 6", "Print History Statements"], "language_status": {"ta": "available", "en": "available"}, "workflow": {"status": "published", "verification_status": "verified", "created_by": "admin", "created_at": "2026-11-05T12:00:00Z", "updated_at": "2026-11-05T12:00:00Z"}, "version": {"current": 1, "previous_version_id": null, "revision_reason": null}}
{"id": "12th_tamil_mp2_q1932", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "multiple_choice", "level": "hard", "difficulty": "hard", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "12", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "megapack_2", "lesson_id": "high_order_masterclass", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "matching_sangam_geography_epigraphy", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "பொருத்துக (தொல்லியல் களங்கள் - கண்டெடுக்கப்பட்ட முதன்மைச் சான்றுகள்):\n(1) கீழடி - (i) இரும்பு உருக்கு ஆலைச் சான்றுகள்\n(2) கொடுமணல் - (ii) தமிழ் பிராமி பொறித்த பானை ஓடுகள் & நகர வடிகால்\n(3) ஆதிச்சநல்லூர் - (iii) உரோமானியப் பானையோடுகள் & துறைமுகம்\n(4) அரிக்கமேடு - (iv) முதுமக்கள் தாழிகள் & வெண்கலப் பொருட்கள்", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "(1)-(i), (2)-(ii), (3)-(iii), (4)-(iv)", "B": "(1)-(iii), (2)-(iv), (3)-(i), (4)-(ii)", "C": "(1)-(iv), (2)-(iii), (3)-(ii), (4)-(i)", "D": "(1)-(ii), (2)-(i), (3)-(iv), (4)-(iii)"}, "explanation": "கீழடி = நகர வடிகால், தமிழ் பிராமி (ii); கொடுமணல் = இரும்பு உருக்குத் தொழில் (i); ஆதிச்சநல்லூர் = முதுமக்கள் தாழிகள் (iv); அரிக்கமேடு = உரோமானிய வணிகத் துறைமுகம் (iii). சரியான வரிசை: D."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "Match the Tamil Nadu archaeological sites with their hallmark discoveries:\n(1) Keeladi - (i) Iron smelting furnaces and carnelian beads\n(2) Kodumanal - (ii) Tamil-Brahmi inscribed potsherds and urban brick drainage\n(3) Adichanallur - (iii) Roman pottery amphorae and Indo-Roman port\n(4) Arikamedu - (iv) Megalithic burial urns and bronze relics", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "(1)-(i), (2)-(ii), (3)-(iii), (4)-(iv)", "B": "(1)-(iii), (2)-(iv), (3)-(i), (4)-(ii)", "C": "(1)-(iv), (2)-(iii), (3)-(ii), (4)-(i)", "D": "(1)-(ii), (2)-(i), (3)-(iv), (4)-(iii)"}, "explanation": "Matching: Keeladi-(ii), Kodumanal-(i), Adichanallur-(iv), Arikamedu-(iii). Correct choice is D."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "sta