{"id": "12th_tamil_mp2_q1936", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "multiple_choice", "level": "medium", "difficulty": "medium", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "12", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "megapack_2", "lesson_id": "final_tnpsc_simulation", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "kambar_guhan_brotherhood", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "‘குகனொடும் ஐவரானேம் முன்பு; பின் குன்று சூழ்வான் மகனொடும் அறுவரானேம்’ - இராமன் இதில் தன் ஏழாவது தம்பியாக யாரை ஏற்றுக்கொள்கிறான்?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "இலக்குவனை", "B": "பரதனை", "C": "சத்துருக்கனனை", "D": "வீடணனை (விபீஷணனை)"}, "explanation": "குகனுடன் ஐவர், சுக்கிரீவனுடன் அறுவர், அடைக்கலம் புகுந்த வீடணனோடு சேர்த்து எழுவரானோம் என்று இராமன் கூறுகிறான்."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "In Kamba Ramayanam, whom does Rama embrace as his seventh brother alongside Guha and Sugriva?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "Lakshmana", "B": "Bharatha", "C": "Shatrughna", "D": "Vibhishana (Veedanan)"}, "explanation": "Rama embraces Guha as the 5th, Sugriva as the 6th, and Vibhishana as the 7th brother."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "D", "accepted_keys": ["D"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "12", "term": "full_year", "edition": "2024-2025", "page": 56, "chapter": null, "section": null, "reference": "12th Tamil, Unit megapack_2, Page 56", "url": nu