{"id": "12th_tamil_mp2_q1945", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "multiple_choice", "level": "medium", "difficulty": "medium", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "12", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "megapack_2", "lesson_id": "final_tnpsc_simulation", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "kuriyedu_modern_tamil_poet", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "‘கூண்டு திறந்தாலும் சிறகடிக்க மறந்துவிட்ட பறவை’ - இத்தொடரில் பறவை எதன் குறியீடாக நிற்கிறது?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "சுதந்திரம் கிடைத்தாலும் அடிமைப் பழக்கத்திலிருந்து விடுபட முடியாத மனித மனம்", "B": "பறவையின் இயலாமை", "C": "இயற்கையின் அழிவு", "D": "மழைக்காலம்"}, "explanation": "கூண்டு திறந்த பின்னும் பறக்காத பறவை என்பது நீண்டகால அடிமைத்தளையால் விடுதலை உணர்வை இழந்த சமூகத்தின் குறியீடாகும்."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "'A bird that forgot to flutter its wings even when its cage was opened' - What does this bird symbolize?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "The conditioned human mind unable to embrace freedom due to internalized subjugation", "B": "Physical disability of the avian species", "C": "Destruction of forest ecology", "D": "Monsoon weather"}, "explanation": "The caged bird represents internalized oppression and psychological paralysis even when emancipated."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "A", "accepted_keys": ["A"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Servic