{"id": "12th_tamil_mp2_q1957", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "multiple_choice", "level": "medium", "difficulty": "medium", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "12", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "megapack_2", "lesson_id": "final_tnpsc_simulation", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "ratchanya_yaathirigam_devotion", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "‘ஆதியன் புருவா யுலகெலாந் தொழநின் றற்புதக் கடவுளன் பாகி...’ - இப்பாடல் இரட்சணிய யாத்திரிகத்தில் எந்தப் பருவத்தில் தொடங்குகிறது?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "ஆதி பருவம்", "B": "குமார பருவம்", "C": "நிதான பருவம்", "D": "இரட்சணிய பருவம்"}, "explanation": "இரட்சணிய யாத்திரிகத்தின் முதற்பிரிவான 'ஆதி பருவம்' இறைவனின் முதன்மைத் தன்மையையும் உலகப் படைப்பையும் போற்றும் கடவுள் வாழ்த்தோடு தொடங்குகிறது."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "With which Paruvam does H.A. Krishna Pillai's epic 'Ratchanya Yaathirigam' commence?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "Aadhi Paruvam (Initial Genesis Section)", "B": "Kumara Paruvam", "C": "Nidhana Paruvam", "D": "Ratchanya Paruvam"}, "explanation": "The epic begins with 'Aadhi Paruvam', invoking God's eternal majesty and universal compassion."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "A", "accepted_keys": ["A"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "12", "term": "full_year", "edition": "2024-2025", "page": 168, "chapter": null, "